{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Kaz, what kind of shape is that plant the\n\"professor\" gave us in?\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "First time I laid eyes on it, I thought it was some\nkind of joke.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "It was a giant birdhouse - seagulls everywhere.\n", "reason": "newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We eventually scraped off most of the rust and\nbird crap.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "The underlying structure's intact - a little elbow\ngrease and we should be in business.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Who used to own it, anyway?\n", "reason": "newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Whatever shape it's in now, somebody sank some\nserious money into building it.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "From what I can tell, an American university built it\nas a research platform\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "for ocean thermal energy conversion, \"OTEC.\"\n", "reason": "newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "The name's still on some of the rusty old power\nturbines.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "It was a giant birdhouse - seagulls everywhere.\n", "reason": "longer 48->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Kaz, what kind of shape is that plant the\n\"professor\" gave us in?\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "First time I laid eyes on it, I thought it was some\nkind of joke.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We eventually scraped off most of the rust and\nbird crap.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "The underlying structure's intact - a little elbow\ngrease and we should be in business.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Whatever shape it's in now, somebody sank some\nserious money into building it.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "From what I can tell, an American university built it\nas a research platform\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "The name's still on some of the rusty old power\nturbines.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I'm guessing they must have had government and\ncorporate assistance to build it, too.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "But they couldn't solve the thermal efficiency\nproblem, and the project was canceled.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "a KGB front company scooped it up for next to\nnothing... At least, that's my theory.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "How'd the KGB manage to buy a plant built with\nAmerican capital, front company or not?\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "the plant's set up so that it can join up with other\nplants of the same standard.\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "So they were originally planning on expanding the\nplace, huh?\n", "reason": "newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Helicopters have quicker response time. Sounds\nstrange, yeah, but it works great, I promise.\n", "reason": "longer 93->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah, I hope so.\n", "reason": "longer 17->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "One world. No gaps, no rifts.\n", "reason": "longer 30->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We need money, too - money to train soldiers to\nfight.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "OK.\n", "reason": "longer 4->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "And that's it. We finished installing the recovery\nhook on the Huey...\n", "reason": "longer 71->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Normally, Fulton recovery is for when you're using\nfixed-wing aircraft.\n", "reason": "longer 72->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We want to keep the risk of taking enemy fire to a\nminimum.\n", "reason": "longer 60->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Thought so. Kaz, I know we need to keep costs\ndown, but...\n", "reason": "longer 59->68"}
