{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_02.po", "msgid": "Press the OK Button to specify the team to which\nto assign the soldier.", "reason": "repair-failed newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_02.po", "msgid": "Use wireless LAN Access Points (AP) to recruit volunteers to MSF. \nVolunteer recruits are experienced veteran soldiers who will\nwant to evaluate the true strength of the MSF and Snake\nbefore they agre", "reason": "repair-failed newline 4->3"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "Capture the quetzal.", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Please... get them out of my country... \nMake them leave Costa Rica. ", "reason": "longer 69->82"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Sorry, kid... ", "reason": "longer 14->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "We know who you are, Big Boss.\nThat is why we've come to you.", "reason": "longer 61->72"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Here.", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Lies, obviously.", "reason": "longer 16->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Even after Cuba, we've managed to\nmaintain a delicate balance with the U.S.", "reason": "longer 75->76"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "And your government\ncan't just give 'em the boot?", "reason": "longer 49->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "...That you will fight any foe.", "reason": "longer 31->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Metal Gear ZEKE", "reason": "longer 15->20"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "They're not ours, of course.", "reason": "longer 28->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_04.po", "msgid": "W. UNIT- SCRAP", "reason": "longer 14->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "EDIT MENU:", "reason": "longer 10->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "CLIENT MENU", "reason": "longer 11->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "GAME MODE", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "HELP", "reason": "longer 4->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_02.po", "msgid": "CO-OPS INFO", "reason": "longer 11->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_02.po", "msgid": "HOST", "reason": "longer 4->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "It's been exactly twelve hours since we\nadministered the drug.", "reason": "repair-failed newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_03.po", "msgid": "When enabled, players that have killed a\nteammate three or more times will be kicked.", "reason": "repair-failed newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "We want this land.", "reason": "longer 18->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "We're nomads, we always will be.", "reason": "longer 32->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Our friend the \"professor\"... is likely KGB.", "reason": "longer 44->63"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "I see...", "reason": "longer 8->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Huh?", "reason": "longer 4->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "I was a heavy smoker. ", "reason": "longer 22->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "in Nicaragua.", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "What?", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Hmm. You mean her words about peace?", "reason": "longer 36->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "WALK UNIT", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Change Metal Gear ZEKE's parts.", "reason": "longer 31->38"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "and then they kill us like pigs.", "reason": "longer 32->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Then el monstruo attacked...", "reason": "longer 28->29"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Y mi viejo...", "reason": "longer 13->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I owe you one.", "reason": "longer 14->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "But, I prefer cigarettes, you know.", "reason": "longer 35->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "How do I look? A little like El Che, no?", "reason": "longer 40->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You Cubano?", "reason": "longer 11->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Yea umm... Quetzals.", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Quien es?", "reason": "longer 9->11"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "El Che?", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "No way.", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Sandinistas, right?", "reason": "longer 19->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Mi viejo...", "reason": "longer 11->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "He's dead.", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Relax, I'm not your enemy.", "reason": "longer 26->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Cuban?", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Hmph... A Cigar?", "reason": "longer 16->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Mi viejo, papá... He was la esperanza - our hope.", "reason": "longer 50->75"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Amanda!", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "See what I mean?", "reason": "longer 16->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "El colibri!", "reason": "longer 11->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Let me smoke too!", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Chico!", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Wh... what?!", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...Boss is alive in Costa Rica?", "reason": "longer 31->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Wait!", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Snake?", "reason": "longer 6->8"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I'll do it for the girl. For Paz.", "reason": "longer 33->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "OK... For peace, then.", "reason": "longer 22->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...Freeze!", "reason": "longer 10->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You'll fall!", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Chico...", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "What? What is it?", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Can you... roll me one?", "reason": "longer 23->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Hm?", "reason": "longer 3->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Yeah.", "reason": "longer 5->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Hmm?", "reason": "longer 4->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Kaz, can you hear me?", "reason": "longer 21->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "MSF here.", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "A front. It's a drug refining plant.", "reason": "longer 36->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "The KGB set it up for us to run.", "reason": "longer 32->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Mi viejo never said a word, but we all knew.", "reason": "longer 44->48"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Ooh... everyone except Chico.", "reason": "longer 29->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "He brought it all together...", "reason": "longer 29->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "But it's all over. We lost our cacique. Papá...", "reason": "longer 48->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Here... I rolled you one.", "reason": "longer 25->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Must be important, mmm?", "reason": "longer 23->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You must do something for me.\nIf you... can't save Chico...", "reason": "longer 59->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I want you to... ease his pain... \nEnd his humiliation...", "reason": "longer 57->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...Why?", "reason": "longer 7->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Nice going, Boss.", "reason": "longer 17->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Nukes.", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "They're bringing nukes into Costa Rica.", "reason": "longer 39->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Loud and clear. You found a radio?!", "reason": "longer 35->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I found a map of their bases.", "reason": "longer 29->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Up toward Irazu.", "reason": "longer 16->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Yeah, and I'm Papá Noel.\nThose guys are UCLAs.", "reason": "longer 47->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Whatever it is, it's not us...", "reason": "longer 30->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Es un hombre nuevo. An unmanned weapon.\nA robot!", "reason": "longer 48->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Find Chico! ¡Venceremos!", "reason": "longer 25->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Shoot it!", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "What is that? A quetzal?", "reason": "longer 24->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "So? So what?!", "reason": "longer 13->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...poisonous... I... to get rid of it.", "reason": "longer 38->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...I chase it away.", "reason": "longer 19->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Go home!", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Boss...", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Ahh, I feel alive again...", "reason": "longer 26->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Your... unit?", "reason": "longer 13->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...I'm Snake. Serpiente.", "reason": "longer 24->32"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "\"Snake?\"", "reason": "longer 8->14"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "the great cacique...", "reason": "longer 20->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "patria libre o morir... ", "reason": "longer 24->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Wha-? Nukes?!", "reason": "longer 13->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "He... Oh, Chico...", "reason": "longer 18->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Just tell me where I need to go.", "reason": "longer 32->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Somoza's guardia chased us out of Nicaragua,", "reason": "longer 44->54"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Snake is fine.", "reason": "longer 14->20"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "What's that?", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Nothing.", "reason": "longer 8->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Ahhh...", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Metal...Gear...", "reason": "longer 15->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Mr. Kojima!", "reason": "longer 11->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Damn it! You found me!", "reason": "longer 22->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Ahhh... ", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You used me.", "reason": "longer 12->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "BTR-60 PA Custom", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "BTR-60 PB Custom", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Amanda?", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "The factory... You saw it?", "reason": "longer 26->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Curses!", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Wh... who's there...?", "reason": "longer 21->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Chico? It's me.", "reason": "longer 15->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You're...", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Whoa, is that... Che's?", "reason": "longer 23->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Can I see it?", "reason": "longer 13->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Those photos?", "reason": "longer 13->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Oh no... Amanda!", "reason": "longer 16->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "She's hurt?!", "reason": "longer 12->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "A cigar, huh...", "reason": "longer 15->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Hey!", "reason": "longer 4->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Please, you must drive them out of \nour defenseless country.", "reason": "longer 60->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Yes. As our deterrent.", "reason": "longer 22->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "But,", "reason": "longer 4->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "we can offer you this, \na forward operating base.", "reason": "longer 49->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "...I'll see what I can do.", "reason": "longer 26->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Please! You must help us!", "reason": "longer 25->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "No,", "reason": "longer 3->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "I'm not here on their behalf.", "reason": "longer 29->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "W-wait!", "reason": "longer 7->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Hey, you OK?", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "You know, ", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Yes...", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \nI'm not a kid. I'm twelve! ", "reason": "longer 63->76"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Ulysses? Hmm, \nI didn't think they lived in Costa Rica.", "reason": "longer 55->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Morphos, maybe?", "reason": "longer 18->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Our place is \"Outer Heaven.\" You'd fit right in.", "reason": "longer 48->60"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Outer Heaven... ?", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Call me Snake.", "reason": "longer 17->20"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...You see that there?", "reason": "longer 22->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "But mi viejo...", "reason": "longer 15->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Papá...", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I do but... ", "reason": "longer 12->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...I wish I was dead.", "reason": "longer 21->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Wha-?!", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Any last words?", "reason": "longer 15->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Bingo.", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "but, man, what a basket case! \nShe hates EVERYBODY.", "reason": "longer 51->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Yeah, it's, um... it's from me to Dr. Strangelove.", "reason": "longer 50->63"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Don't read it, OK?", "reason": "longer 21->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Legs. Walking power.", "reason": "longer 20->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Metal Gear...", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Its brain.", "reason": "longer 10->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Tonight, I stand before \nyou as an educator. ", "reason": "longer 45->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "You think it's rebels\nwho've fled Nicaragua?", "reason": "longer 44->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Thank you, Big Boss!", "reason": "longer 20->23"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Oh, uh, sorry... Vic Boss!", "reason": "longer 26->35"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_05.po", "msgid": "Listen up. For us, there is no victory.", "reason": "longer 39->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Right, the quetzal.", "reason": "longer 19->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Fresh out.", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "I am loyal to myself.", "reason": "longer 21->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Unmanned?", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Why build them here?", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Peace Walker...", "reason": "longer 15->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Hey.", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "French...", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Oh, yes... she often sang...", "reason": "longer 28->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Sang...?", "reason": "longer 8->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Close, but not quite. Outer Heaven.", "reason": "longer 35->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "A large tube, in the back...", "reason": "longer 28->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...\"Jack.\"", "reason": "longer 10->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Please, do not kill me...", "reason": "longer 25->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "I am a tourist...", "reason": "longer 17->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Please...", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Cécile Cosima Caminades.", "reason": "longer 25->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Haa... You saved me.", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "They told me it was every birder's dream.\nBut... they were wrong.", "reason": "longer 65->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Dr. Strangelove...", "reason": "longer 18->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "But...", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Coldman needs funding for that. \nAnd to get it, he's planning a test,", "reason": "longer 69->79"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Voice?", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Jack...", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "A what?! So she's, uh... pretty foxy?", "reason": "longer 37->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "On my way.", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Doctor!", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...Peace won't just come to us, doc.", "reason": "longer 36->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "I work here. Well, used to, anyway. Name's Huey.", "reason": "longer 48->54"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Me? I'm... an entomologist.", "reason": "longer 27->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "A... fighting... entomologist?", "reason": "longer 30->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...she betrayed America. ", "reason": "longer 25->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "What... ", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "It can't be...", "reason": "longer 14->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Boss...?!", "reason": "longer 9->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "You...", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...I've been waiting, Snake.", "reason": "longer 28->35"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Yes, I know. Just as I know \nwhat you did 10 years ago.", "reason": "longer 55->69"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Kill me!", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "What she took, and what was taken from her.", "reason": "longer 43->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...You what?", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "A man...", "reason": "longer 8->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Mammal Pod?", "reason": "longer 11->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "No...", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Really...", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "It's not for kids.", "reason": "longer 18->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "Cargo? What cargo?", "reason": "longer 18->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_06.po", "msgid": "...A spirit.", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "So what will you do now?", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "I... I'm done with science.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "At this rate, I'm probably already \nhalfway to hell anyway.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Not so fast. Why not join us?", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Anyway, long story short, the butterfly got away.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "So how about it, doc? \nDid you make that big \"butterfly\" too?", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"那你现在打算怎么办？\", \"2\": \"我……我已经不搞科学了。\", \"3\": \"照这样下去，我大概已经\\n半只脚踏进地狱了。\", \"4\": \"别急着走。何不加入我们？\", \"5\": \"总之，长话短说，那只蝴蝶跑了。\", \"6\": \"那么，博士？\\n那只大“蝴蝶”也是你造的吗？\", \"7\": \"是……\", \"8\": \"也不是。\", \"9\": \"那东西是什么？它们在这里干什么？\", \"1"}
