{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "The gun's for self-defense.\nI'm looking for... that one rare bird... in Costa Rica.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"玛雅遗迹竟奇迹般挺过了\\n数百年地震。\", \"2\": \"玛雅遗迹中的AI研究所。\", \"3\": \"谁能想到呢，休伊？\", \"4\": \"我完全同意。但这不代表\\n安保就松懈了。\", \"5\": \"我给你的ID卡还带着吧？\", \"6\": \"就在这儿。\", \"7\": \"有它你过大门没问题。\\n之后就得靠你自己了。\", \"8\": \"只要AI还没组装完成，\\n科尔德曼的计划就搁置着。\", \"9\""}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "Which one? The quetzal?", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"玛雅遗迹竟奇迹般挺过了\\n数百年地震。\", \"2\": \"玛雅遗迹中的AI研究所。\", \"3\": \"谁能想到呢，休伊？\", \"4\": \"我完全同意。但这不代表\\n安保就松懈了。\", \"5\": \"我给你的ID卡还带着吧？\", \"6\": \"就在这儿。\", \"7\": \"有它你过大门没问题。\\n之后就得靠你自己了。\", \"8\": \"只要AI还没组装完成，\\n科尔德曼的计划就搁置着。\", \"9\""}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Care for a sniff?", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "...Follow me.", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "What's your real goal here?", "reason": "longer 27->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_07.po", "msgid": "To clear her name.", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Jack, you've returned.", "reason": "longer 25->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...I see.", "reason": "longer 9->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "What is it, Jack?", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Boss?", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "regrets?", "reason": "longer 8->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Regrets?", "reason": "longer 8->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "The one in Groznyj Grad.", "reason": "longer 24->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I know all about you. \nTselinoyarsk? Ten years ago?", "reason": "longer 51->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "You were involved...?", "reason": "longer 21->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "My aim is... a new world order.", "reason": "longer 31->48"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "A new age is dawning.", "reason": "longer 21->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "An age in which Peace Walker,", "reason": "longer 29->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "will play a vital role.", "reason": "longer 23->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Bring him.", "reason": "longer 10->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "What..?", "reason": "longer 7->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Jack?", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...is the mission, Jack.", "reason": "longer 24->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "even in those we love.", "reason": "longer 22->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Why... For what purpose...?", "reason": "longer 27->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Why?! Who is it?! What are you protecting?!", "reason": "longer 43->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "And you...!", "reason": "longer 11->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Why... Why not just give up...?", "reason": "longer 31->48"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "He's passed out...", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...kill me...", "reason": "longer 13->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Stop it!", "reason": "longer 8->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "kill me...", "reason": "longer 10->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Shut up!", "reason": "longer 8->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "SHUT UP!", "reason": "longer 8->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...You...", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "But first...", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "China, France - even India - have surpassed us. ", "reason": "longer 48->60"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Chico?", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "You bastard...", "reason": "longer 14->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Paz...!", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Don't you see, Snake? We need nukes -\ncontrolled nukes - to have peace.", "reason": "longer 71->96"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Lies!", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Don't do it, Jack.", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I'm loyal... to the end, to my purpose.", "reason": "longer 39->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "What really happened?! What did you see?!", "reason": "longer 41->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Did she defect or not?", "reason": "longer 25->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "They found me...!", "reason": "longer 17->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Kaz?", "reason": "longer 4->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Snake, you OK?", "reason": "longer 14->23"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I'm coming, Paz.", "reason": "longer 16->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Big Boss, you made it.", "reason": "longer 22->26"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "False data?", "reason": "longer 11->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Honduras, Nicaragua, Costa Rica, Panama...", "reason": "longer 42->63"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Ensure people in the know keep \ntheir mouths shut,", "reason": "repair-failed newline 1->0"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "And one Snake...", "reason": "longer 16->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "That... ", "reason": "longer 8->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Good.", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I won't.", "reason": "longer 8->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Her story... her debriefing...", "reason": "longer 30->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "WHAT?!", "reason": "longer 6->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Think, Coldman. We're on an American base, ", "reason": "longer 43->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "such is the Kremlin's plan.", "reason": "longer 27->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Paz, come here...", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Shoot him.", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Professor Gálvez...?", "reason": "longer 21->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Hm... I am Vladimir Zadornov, ", "reason": "longer 30->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\"\nNow do as you're told, Paz.", "reason": "longer 64->76"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "I can't...", "reason": "longer 10->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No, wait!", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No, not that...", "reason": "longer 15->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Very well.", "reason": "longer 13->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Good. It is done. As for you, Big Boss...", "reason": "longer 41->47"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Why do you think I summoned you to Costa Rica, ", "reason": "longer 47->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "You mean... Amanda?! And the Sandinistas...!", "reason": "longer 44->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Che Guevara?", "reason": "longer 15->23"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Paz?", "reason": "longer 4->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Thank you.", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...What's that noise?", "reason": "longer 21->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "What'd he do...?!", "reason": "longer 17->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...NORAD's nightmare is about to begin.", "reason": "longer 39->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "What?! And the target's Cuba?", "reason": "longer 29->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "to NORAD.", "reason": "longer 9->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No, she's alive.", "reason": "longer 16->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "And... I'm sorry.", "reason": "longer 17->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...I'll live.", "reason": "longer 13->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Boss.", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No!", "reason": "longer 3->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "You're late.", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Professor?", "reason": "longer 13->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Zadornov, you backstabbing son of a...!", "reason": "longer 39->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Launch a nuke... Target: Cuba.", "reason": "longer 30->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Coldman's aim ", "reason": "longer 14->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "like Peace Walker.", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Take him away.", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Kill me.", "reason": "longer 11->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I killed her.", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...No, that is not what I want to know.", "reason": "longer 39->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Do it... ", "reason": "longer 12->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "kill me... ", "reason": "longer 11->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "kill me now...", "reason": "longer 14->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Stop it...", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Liar! She's NOT a traitor!", "reason": "longer 26->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Do it... kill me... I killed her...", "reason": "longer 35->48"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Please, stop... stop it...", "reason": "longer 26->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Just up the voltage... Kill me...", "reason": "longer 36->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "I've got NORAD on the line.", "reason": "longer 27->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...ce", "reason": "longer 5->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...Go to DEFCON 3.", "reason": "longer 18->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Get SAC on the phone.", "reason": "longer 21->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "...They're at DEFCON 3.", "reason": "longer 23->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Indeed I was...", "reason": "longer 15->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No, it's the real Big Boss. Trust me.", "reason": "longer 37->44"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...Snake!", "reason": "longer 9->14"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Jesus... Coldman guessed wrong!", "reason": "longer 31->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "500 tons.", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Wait...", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Valid data regions: Zero.", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Exit all done.", "reason": "longer 14->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Why?!", "reason": "longer 5->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Answer me!!", "reason": "longer 11->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "ANSWER ME!!!", "reason": "longer 12->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "BO-O-O-OSS!!!!", "reason": "longer 14->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No, sir.", "reason": "longer 8->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Then who?", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "He, um...", "reason": "longer 9->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "We have to retaliate or more Americans die.", "reason": "longer 43->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Then put him on!", "reason": "longer 16->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "It stopped moving... Snake, you did it.\nYou stopped the launch!", "reason": "longer 63->69"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Huey, how's NORAD?!", "reason": "longer 19->51"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Not good... ", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Go to DEFCON 2. Prepare to launch ICBMs.", "reason": "longer 40->54"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Then say it. Say she died for America!", "reason": "longer 38->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...No...", "reason": "longer 8->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...That woman...", "reason": "longer 16->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "...was a traitor!", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Why?! Why won't it stop?!", "reason": "longer 25->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "No... ", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "What...?", "reason": "longer 8->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "That song...", "reason": "longer 12->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Look!", "reason": "longer 5->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Freeze!", "reason": "longer 7->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Boss, you hurt...?", "reason": "longer 18->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "I'm fine.", "reason": "longer 9->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Vic Boss!", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Vic Boss...", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "And the \"professor\"?", "reason": "longer 20->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Sorry, kitty, but I'm no hunter.", "reason": "longer 32->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Whaa?! Oh, man... ", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "and not a single customer so far... ", "reason": "longer 36->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "...Fine...", "reason": "longer 10->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Free Control Time", "reason": "longer 17->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Nurse", "reason": "longer 5->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "(不要)AIヘリ", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Spy", "reason": "longer 3->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Begin!", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Again!", "reason": "longer 6->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Good!", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Umm... Boss?", "reason": "longer 12->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "I noticed that.", "reason": "longer 15->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_08.po", "msgid": "Go!", "reason": "longer 3->6"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "Do you hear it, Snake? \nDo you hear The Boss' song?", "reason": "longer 51->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "You saw it, didn't you?", "reason": "longer 23->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_09.po", "msgid": "At last I understand. In the end...", "reason": "longer 35->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Roll!", "reason": "longer 5->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_10.po", "msgid": "Fantastic!", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
