{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A state-of-the-art, man-portable anti-tank missile that just recently entered service in the U.S. military. The launcher is disposable and good for only one shot.\n\nThe M47 employs an optical, wired gu", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A unique weapon that effectively renders the target optically invisible. The result of the combined efforts of the entire Mother Base R&D Team.\n\nBecause of its large size, it cannot be operated withou", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "One of the structural elements of the human slingshot, the ultimate CO-OP weapon. With enough mechanical strength to withstand the rigors of the giant rubber band that comes with it, it also makes a f", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "One of the structural elements of the human slingshot, the ultimate CO-OP weapon. This rubber band is incredibly powerful and can launch a brawny 200-pound soldier a considerable distance.\n\nThe power ", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A standard fragmentation grenade. It deals damage with the force of its blast and the shrapnel it scatters.\n\nExceptionally powerful versus human targets - most enemy soldiers will go down in a single ", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A non-lethal weapon filled with a magnesium-based explosive. When it detonates, it emits a blinding flash of light, an ear-splitting bang, and an intense shockwave that combine to knock targets uncons", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A non-lethal weapon that scatters a cloud of metal strips when detonated, scrambling nearby electronic devices. When surrounded by unmanned weapons, a chaff grenade can turn the tables in an instant. ", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A grenade that releases smoke when ignited. It does no physical damage. The smoke clouds the enemy's vision, which can be a godsend when the user needs to get out of sight quickly. Remember that the s", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A smoke grenade that releases colored smoke. Works exactly the same way as a regular smoke grenade. Available in a variety of colors for your convenience.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A non-lethal grenade that releases sleeping gas when it detonates. Anyone who inhales the gas will fall asleep within a certain amount of time. Throwing multiple grenades will increase the potency of ", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "An empty ammo magazine. It is useless as a weapon, but it can be thrown to make a noise and thereby distract the enemy.\n\nAdded to your inventory each time you reload a gun.", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A marker for requesting support supplies from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location where the supplies are to be dropped. To use it, throw it the same way you would throw a grenade.\n\nUseful i", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A marker for requesting support strikes from Mother Base. The marker indicates the location of the attack. To use it, throw it the same way you would throw a grenade.\n\nUse it to gain the upper hand in", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A high-power electromagnetic net used to capture large enemy war machines.\n\nWhen activated, it generates a powerful magnetic field several teslas in magnitude, freezing enemy war machines in their tra", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "A military-grade plastic explosive, employed by the U.S. military and other militaries worldwide.\n\nIt has 1.34 times the destructive power of TNT and can be molded into virtually any shape.\n\nC4 is the", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\slot\\slot_25.po", "msgid": "An anti-personnel mine that focuses its blast in a specific direction. Upon detonation, it sprays 700 steel balls across a 60-degree arc, Although developed for anti-personnel use, it is also effectiv", "reason": "unparsable: {\"1\": \"一种一次性火箭筒，旨在为步兵提供攻击轻型装甲车和碉堡等硬目标的手段。它轻便紧凑，士兵可一次携带数具而不影响行动。\\n\\nLAW 火箭筒体积虽小威力却大；一发就能将一整群敌人一举歼灭。\\n\\n使用 LAW 时请留意剩余数量，每具发射器只能使用一次。\", \"2\": \"一种装有四发火箭弹的火箭发射器，可连续发射，让使用者迅速倾泻大量火力。\\n\\n缺点是重量和体积使操作相当不便。因此最好用于"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "\"Cipher\"... Ring any bells, Kaz?\n", "reason": "longer 33->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Cipher... Cipher... it means \"code.\" Or \"zero\" in\nArabic numerals.\n", "reason": "longer 67->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Not sure.\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "OK.\n", "reason": "longer 4->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "...We're not warmongers.\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We're the real Peace Walkers.\n", "reason": "longer 30->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Still can't believe Professor Gálvez was KGB...\n", "reason": "longer 49->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah, the Cuban intel services are all in the KGB's\npocket.\n", "reason": "longer 60->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "What do you think, Kaz? Why did Paz come all the\nway to Colombia herself?\n", "reason": "longer 74->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "It is a long trip to make just to be Exhibit A in\nGálvez's sales pitch...\n", "reason": "longer 75->96"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "She's only 16 - still a kid. Maybe we should take\nher wish for peace at face value.\n", "reason": "longer 84->88"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Remember that habit Paz had, Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 36->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah. It bugged me ever since we first met her...\nNever figured her for a snuff user.\n", "reason": "longer 86->101"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I can't believe we never noticed.\n", "reason": "longer 34->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "How could Paz... We were going to start a band\ntogether...\n", "reason": "longer 59->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Thought so. Kaz, I know we need to keep costs\ndown, but...\n", "reason": "longer 59->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Only with that kind of power can we break free of\nnation-states.\n", "reason": "longer 65->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Wait, Kaz, something doesn't make sense about this\nwhole process.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "With a helicopter, isn't it simpler to land and pick\nup directly?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Can you believe the CIA and the KGB were actually\nin cahoots?\n", "reason": "longer 62->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Never thought I'd see that at the station chief\nlevel...\n", "reason": "longer 57->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Most espionage takes place in political hotspots, as\nyou'd expect.\n", "reason": "longer 67->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "but its weakness is in its susceptibility to those\nsame emotions.\n", "reason": "longer 66->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "A network of cold, digital data, where feelings are\nirrelevant.\n", "reason": "longer 64->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "One of them caught my eye.\n", "reason": "longer 27->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I'm with you there. Can you believe that when he\nfirst went to Cuba with Fidel,\n", "reason": "longer 80->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "But we've got to keep on going. It's not just about\nwinning in battle.\n", "reason": "longer 71->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "How so?\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "He led the Cuban Revolution to victory. That's\nquite an accomplishment.\n", "reason": "longer 72->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "First in the Congo, then in Bolivia - where he met\nhis end.\n", "reason": "longer 60->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "But I still can't help thinking the reason you look\nup to Che\n", "reason": "longer 62->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "You wander from one battlefield to another, going\nwherever you're needed...\n", "reason": "longer 76->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Che was a revolutionary as well as a warrior. He\ntook up arms to fight for his beliefs.\n", "reason": "longer 88->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I don't do what I do for any ideology. I'm a warrior.\nNothing more, nothing less.\n", "reason": "longer 82->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "OK, Boss. You're right. Just wanted to see how we\nstacked up against a real hero.\n", "reason": "longer 82->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "T.E. Lawrence - \"Lawrence of Arabia\" - was another\none.\n", "reason": "longer 56->90"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Theory aside, Nicaragua's General Sandino\n", "reason": "longer 42->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Which explains why the Sandinistas named\nthemselves after him.\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "...Those words really hit me hard. Especially when I\nthink of my mom.\n", "reason": "longer 70->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "He said something else, too: \"Let us all love\nHiroshima, and its people.\"\n", "reason": "longer 74->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "That bandanna you're always wearing - that thing's\na real antique.\n", "reason": "longer 67->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Come on, we can't have our Boss wearing a\nraggedy old thing like that...\n", "reason": "longer 73->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "One of his comrades gave it to him when he broke\nhis arm in battle.\n", "reason": "longer 68->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "and the comrade who gave it to him became his\nsecond wife.\n", "reason": "longer 59->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Trojan Horse-style maneuvers and decoys to\nconfuse the enemy...\n", "reason": "longer 64->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah, the problems never seem to end around\nhere...\n", "reason": "longer 52->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I wonder if Che and his men ever sat around drank\nmate.\n", "reason": "longer 56->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I bet they did. Che was famous for his love of the\nstuff.\n", "reason": "longer 58->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Man, whoever thought of this was a genius. You\ncan put it in a gourd and carry it around,\n", "reason": "longer 90->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Your old mentor, The Boss...\n", "reason": "longer 29->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We're nomads. Wanderers.\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Right.\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "She was known in the West as the \"Mother of\nSpecial Forces,\" right?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I heard the KGB just set up a counter-sabotage\ncell. Alpha Group, I think they call it.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "There's even a rumor that West Germany created\na counter-terrorist unit within its\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "border police after the debacle at the Munich\nOlympics.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Back home in the States, they've got the illustrious\nGreen Berets,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "the SEALs, and your personal creation,\nFOXHOUND...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "The seeds sown by The Boss are beginning to\nsprout.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Same goes for MSF, right? In creating it, you were\ncarrying on the will of The Boss.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "She taught me how to fight, the hard way - she\nbeat it into me.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "And now thanks to her, we can take on missions\nother than just conventional combat.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "After all, we've got the same mother as the Army's\nSpecial Forces.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "You know, Snake, you're right. As long as we're\n\"soldiers without borders,\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "we're going to be a target. We need our own\ndeterrent.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "We're going to be stepping into a lot of different\nconflicts as we roam the world.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Each one unique, and with its own set of\ngeography, ideologies, and politics.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "If we're going to intervene in those kinds of\nsituations,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "...Unless we want to end up like Che Guevara did in\nBolivia.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Well said. Our army without borders doesn't have a\nland to call home.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "What we need now is a sheepdog to guard our\nflock.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Maybe it's not the way The Boss would have gone\nabout it...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "..Ha. So, you used to be part of a CIA paramilitary\nunit, right?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "No, not personally. But there were other units who\ndid all kinds of stuff.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "\"Operation Zapata\" - that was the CIA codename.\nThe whole thing went south.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Then there was Che Guevara being hunted down in\nBolivia.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "There were several units similar to mine. MSP,\nSOG...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "They'd recruit former Special Forces, train them as\nintelligence agents, and send them on\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "One of those units trained the Bolivian Army in\ncounter-guerilla tactics....\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Around here, they say \"La CIA\", instead of \"C-I-A,\"\nhuh?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Nothing strange about it. That's how it's\npronounced when you read it in Spanish.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "It has the feminine noun ending \"a,\" so they use\nthe article \"la.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Apparently some people have even taken to using\nthe term UCLA.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah, that's the idea. Washington uses them like\npawns,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "and nobody knows who they really are or what\nthey're doing.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "He said something about selling it off as a photo\nof a UFO...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Looks like it found its way into the pages of a\nmagazine.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "But... why would the prime minister of a country\nbelieve tabloid trash like that?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "There's been reports all over the Americas of\nabductions and cattle mutilations, lately.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I know. If he digs too deep, he's gonna get himself\ninto trouble.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "I guess that would make it tough for the CIA to\nintervene, in a sense.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Upsetting the domestic balance of power could\ncause it to go Red all of a sudden.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "True... Well, in any case it's not like we can do\nanything about it.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Gotcha. I'll be careful not to let any more photos\nleak.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "So I hear Amanda mistook you for Che Guevara,\nSnake.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Yeah, right. I'm not even worthy of polishing his\nboots.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "From where I'm standing, your men see you as a\ngreat man.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "As great as \"the century's most complete human\nbeing\"?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "That's Sartre, right? Well, there's hardly been a\nmore iconic figure of his times than Che.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "He was more than that. He was a true\nrevolutionary, and a great warrior.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "- he dumped boiling water and human excrement\non them...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "He snuck out of his hotel and took an overnight\ntrain.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "having a bomb dropped on itself in order to\navenge Japan?\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's not that. I just...\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "They provide decent protection and let you carry\na fair number of weapons. Your standard uniform,\nbasically.\n", "reason": "longer 109->114"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Wear something that clashes and you'll stick out\nlike a sore thumb.\n", "reason": "longer 68->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Even better, you won't make a sound when you\nwalk.\n", "reason": "longer 51->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "And, to top it off, it also makes your wounds heal\nfaster.\n", "reason": "longer 59->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Naked... That's exactly what you are with this\nuniform.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Easy, Kaz.\n", "reason": "longer 11->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Can I ask you a favor, Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 30->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "If you ask nicely.\n", "reason": "longer 19->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "And if you do have to fight, try to leave them near\ndeath instead of dead.\n", "reason": "longer 75->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "And then use the Fulton recovery system...sounds\neasy enough.\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "You know what'd be really nice, though. If we had a\nway to Fulton recover anybody at anytime...\n", "reason": "longer 96->104"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I know. Take only what you need. Every rookie\nknows that.\n", "reason": "longer 58->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Even a born warrior like you gets hand tremors,\nSnake.\n", "reason": "longer 55->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "and it only gets worse when you're tired -\nespecially with larger, heavier weapons.\n", "reason": "longer 84->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "In sync?\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "You'll move faster, recover faster, and have better\ncamouflage.\n", "reason": "longer 64->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "In other words, we're at our best when we're in the\nsame groove.\n", "reason": "longer 65->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "If camaraderie represents how much your\nteammates trust you,\n", "reason": "longer 61->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "\"Heroism?\"\n", "reason": "longer 11->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "...Hilarious\n", "reason": "longer 13->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's also good to note that if you've got a clear,\nspecific objective,\n", "reason": "longer 71->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "Even after his arm healed up, he never went\nanywhere without that scarf.\n", "reason": "longer 73->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_01.po", "msgid": "What about you? You get that bandanna from\nsomeone special?\n", "reason": "longer 60->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I thought that Article 9 you were talking about\nearlier\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "that launches a nuclear strike against an allied\ncountry...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "With higher heroism, it won't take as long to\nconvince guys to join our cause\n", "reason": "longer 78->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Also, getting out there and attacking the enemy in\nCO-OPS\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Now, about CO-OPS Comms.\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "CO-OPS Comms…\n", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's a radio system for communicating with CO-OPS\nteammates.\n", "reason": "longer 61->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "So why'd you quit the JSDF?\n", "reason": "longer 28->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Reason?\n", "reason": "longer 8->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "And personally, I could never get used to the idea\nof exclusive defense.\n", "reason": "longer 73->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Meaning?\n", "reason": "longer 9->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "On a tactical level, though, it just rubbed me the\nwrong way.\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Not that I admired his vision or anything. But it did\nget me thinking, that's for sure.\n", "reason": "longer 88->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I want you to avoid killing enemy soldiers as much\nas possible and send them back using Fulton\nrecovery.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "As we develop better weapons at Mother Base,\nthough,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I'll keep it in mind. Then again, the more you use a\nweapon,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "N-no, I...!\n", "reason": "longer 12->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Ooh, what's that? A tank? I like it!\n", "reason": "longer 37->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Paz?!\n", "reason": "longer 6->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "What?!\n", "reason": "longer 7->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "WALKMAN...\n", "reason": "longer 11->14"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It'd let me listen to my music when I want, where I\nwant.\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I... never thought I'd hear you say that. But I have\nto agree.\n", "reason": "longer 63->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "But now that I've seen it in action, I've changed my\nmind.\n", "reason": "longer 59->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Could be.\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Just go to \"Key Config\".\n", "reason": "longer 25->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Ah... You feeling OK?\n", "reason": "longer 22->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "But to keep it simple, let's call it a sort of \"Battle\nCry.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It signifies that words have power that affect our\nreality...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Offering praise to somebody could make them run\nfaster than usual.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Good for whatever weapon you want to practice\nwith.\n", "reason": "longer 52->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "To hold up an enemy, you need to get behind them\nwithout being seen.\n", "reason": "longer 69->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "No sense in holding up an enemy only to have his\nbuddies attack you, though.\n", "reason": "longer 77->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Yyyyeah, sure, Boss...\n", "reason": "longer 23->29"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I'm sorry, Boss. He meant well, I swear.\n", "reason": "longer 41->47"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Huh?\n", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Y-you're serious? Snake, look at it, it's...\n", "reason": "longer 45->54"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's a masterpiece, in every sense of the word. You\ndon't agree?\n", "reason": "longer 65->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I hate tanks, but this one I think I could get used\nto.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "I love that it's a zero emissions vehicle - it will not\nhurt the forests of Costa Rica.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Nice work, Kaz. I see I made the right choice\nmaking you second in command.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Snake, about that cassette player Gálvez was\ncarrying...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It was the real deal - a prototype developed by a\nJapanese company.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's true. It had the Sony logo on it. The product\nname is \"WALKMAN.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It's a revolutionary new concept. Music you can\nlisten to on the go.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "and you wouldn't believe how good the sound\nquality is for something so tiny.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "And in stereo, too. Think of the technology that\nmust have gone into it.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "The treble range is clearly superior to any other\ncassette ever made. Stylish, too.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "How'd Gálvez get his hands on a model that's not\neven out yet?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Beats me. It's not the kind of thing I'd expect some\nstodgy Soviet to be into.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Me neither. Tell you what, though, it's a fine piece\nof work.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Take as many weapons and items as you can\ncarry.\n", "reason": "longer 49->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "Place it near the barricade and move to a safe\nlocation,\n", "reason": "longer 57->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_02.po", "msgid": "It beats me... They're way too big, even for an\nelephant.\n", "reason": "longer 58->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "When the enemy spots you and goes on alert, they\nmay call in a backup strike team.\n", "reason": "longer 83->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Amanda's crew calls them \"commandos.\"\n", "reason": "longer 38->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Unlike the patrolmen, these guys will actively,\nrelentlessly track and hunt you down - like hounds.\n", "reason": "longer 100->101"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "So don't get too comfy in one spot or you might\nget caught again.\n", "reason": "longer 66->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Also, be aware that commando gear includes body\narmor.\n", "reason": "longer 55->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "All I've got to do is find an exposed weak point\nand...\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "They can take a few hits and still keep charging\nyou.\n", "reason": "longer 54->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "And believe me, you don't want them closing in\nbetween those shotgun blasts.\n", "reason": "longer 77->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Amanda's crew calls them \"scouts.\"\n", "reason": "longer 35->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "For your own safety, make sure you put plenty of\ndistance\n", "reason": "longer 58->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Boss, we're not sure where your gear is being\nstored.\n", "reason": "longer 54->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Amanda and her crew tell me they've managed to\nidentify several different categories\n", "reason": "longer 85->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "For the sake of convenience, Amanda's crew calls\nthe outdoor ones \"patrolmen,\"\n", "reason": "longer 79->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "but don't be fooled - they're sharper than they\nlook.\n", "reason": "longer 54->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "you can forget about one-shot kills. Just a heads\nup.\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Our scouts report that an enemy's defense and\nfiring accuracy\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "...Shine. Like how?\n", "reason": "longer 20->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Costa Rica means \"rich coast\" in Spanish.\n", "reason": "longer 42->57"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "A quarter century later, and it is a tragedy we\nticos cannot forget... Must not forget.\n", "reason": "longer 88->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Part of our job is finding out.\n", "reason": "longer 32->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Exactly. Thanks, Snake. Peace.\n", "reason": "longer 31->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Costa Rica abolished its army,\n", "reason": "longer 31->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Professor Gálvez was a KGB spy...?\n", "reason": "longer 36->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "How could I?! Believe me, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 33->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "But you did?\n", "reason": "longer 13->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "From the first time we met.\n", "reason": "longer 28->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "I wish you'd told me...\n", "reason": "longer 24->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "He reeked.\n", "reason": "longer 11->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Reeked?\n", "reason": "longer 8->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Like me. I could just smell it.\n", "reason": "longer 32->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Doesn't sound like a good idea getting emotionally\nattached...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Here, you try it, Snake. Peace!\n", "reason": "longer 32->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Unlike Costa Rica.\n", "reason": "longer 19->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "You're a curious one, aren't you? Don't study too\nhard.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "How?\n", "reason": "longer 5->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "That's what his book is about. Is the concept\nstarting to sound interesting now?\n", "reason": "longer 81->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I want to you to give me a job here. I want to help\nout.\n", "reason": "longer 57->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "You should probably take it easy until you're\nsettled.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "You would not want me near a gun, but I am a\ndecent cook.\n", "reason": "longer 58->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Put me on the mess hall team - I think I can handle\nit.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I heard them call it \"Puerto del Alba\" - \"Port of\nDawn.\"\n", "reason": "longer 57->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "They have perfect visibility of the area from up\nthere.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "one of the guards spotted us, and we...\n", "reason": "longer 40->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I am sorry, I... I just cannot...\n", "reason": "longer 34->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "You did great, Paz. I won't let your efforts go\nwasted.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "I...\n", "reason": "longer 5->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "...Sorry. But you have to understand how the world\nworks\n", "reason": "longer 57->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "You are right, Snake... Thanks. Peace!\n", "reason": "longer 39->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "What most people envision when they think of\n\"jungle.\"\n", "reason": "longer 55->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Their shade makes it dark near the ground, so be\ncareful.\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Of course, with so little light few plants can grow\non the ground,\n", "reason": "longer 67->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Mud. Great. I'll watch my step.\n", "reason": "longer 32->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "So even if you could photosynthesize, it wouldn't\ndo you any good.\n", "reason": "longer 67->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Sounds dull.\n", "reason": "longer 13->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Including my favorite, the tabebuia.\n", "reason": "longer 37->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "there's a place called La Fortaleza de la\nInmaculada Concepción. That's the only famous one.\n", "reason": "longer 94->110"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Paz, you said Costa Rica has no army, right?\n", "reason": "longer 45->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Costa Rica learned the hard way. That is why it\nabolished its army.\n", "reason": "longer 68->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "...No thanks. It... doesn't suit me.\n", "reason": "longer 37->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "So you live alone now?\n", "reason": "longer 23->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "In a way... My aunts were kind to me and all...\n", "reason": "longer 48->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "...Not at all. I am not strong at all.\n", "reason": "longer 39->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Yeah, I'll do that.\n", "reason": "longer 20->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "because you could be leaving yourself wide open\nto longer-range attacks.\n", "reason": "longer 73->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "What makes them formidable is how well they work\ntogether as a team.\n", "reason": "longer 69->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Yeah, well, see how you feel when you actually\nhave to face them in battle.\n", "reason": "longer 76->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Snake, whatever you do, don't let them surround\nyou.\n", "reason": "longer 53->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "You don't always have to go toe to toe to win a\nfight.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "Think like a guerrilla.\n", "reason": "longer 24->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "and has also hosted the Central American Court of\nJustice.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "He introduced himself as a peace researcher at\nthe university.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_03.po", "msgid": "You might have gotten mixed up in things you\nshouldn't.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Oh, and don't turn your hand around when you do\nit,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "This is a tropical rainforest, just like Bosque del\nAlba.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The temperature and humidity can be brutal. El\nCenegal means \"Place of Mud.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "There are canals here and there carved out by the\nwater.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "But they'll also make it harder for you to see. Be\ncareful, Snake.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The river cut through it, eventually creating a\nvalley.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "There might be another way to get across the\nriver somewhere.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The valley tends to be misty, so you might not be\nable to see the water from up there.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "When a river floods an area, the banks can\ncollapse, creating a marsh.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I'll need to watch the noise my feet make in el\ncenegal.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The river running through here is Río del Jade, or\n\"the Jade River.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Hmm... Doesn't look all that pretty from where I'm\nstanding.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "That fort is a reminder of that senselessness.\n", "reason": "longer 47->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Sadly ironic, given who's occupying it now.\n", "reason": "longer 44->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "That war was the reason Costa Rica abolished the\narmy.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Please, Snake! Get them out of our country!\n", "reason": "longer 44->54"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I intend to.\n", "reason": "longer 13->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Selba de la Leche... \"Forest of Milk.\" I can barely\nsee in front of me.\n", "reason": "longer 72->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "to witness Costa Rica's unique fauna!\n", "reason": "longer 38->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Thank you, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Hence all the plantations.\n", "reason": "longer 27->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I do not know how good that is for Costa Rica in\nthe end.\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "They're an assortment of giant spheres carved\nfrom stone\n", "reason": "longer 57->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "What if I told you some of them are nearly perfect\nspheres?\n", "reason": "longer 60->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "And that they were carved out of granite, which is\nquite a hard substance.\n", "reason": "longer 75->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Gold?! No kidding. I wonder what'd be the fastest\nway to...\n", "reason": "longer 60->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "And it is not just the forest. Without the proper\nprecautions,\n", "reason": "longer 63->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Thanks. Be careful, Snake. Peace!\n", "reason": "longer 34->39"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Xochiquetzal?\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I do not know if I recall such large ruins being\nthere...\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "than an anti-US regime.\n", "reason": "longer 24->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "It connects Lago Cocibolca to el Mar Caribe.\n", "reason": "longer 45->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Juan?\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The Rio San Juan takes its name from San Juan,\nthe man who baptized Jesús.\n", "reason": "longer 76->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "John, huh... I'll be careful anyway. I'd hate to drown\n- end up a John Doe.\n", "reason": "longer 76->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "There is a volcanic island in Lago Cocibolca called\nOmetepe.\n", "reason": "longer 61->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "It's formed from two connected volcanoes, shaped\nlike a porongo (gourd).\n", "reason": "longer 73->75"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "That's the one. The smoking volcano is\nConcepción. It erupts once in a while.\n", "reason": "longer 79->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The other one is Maderas.\n", "reason": "longer 26->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "If that happens, my country is doomed. Snake, you\nmust stop Peace Walker!\n", "reason": "longer 74->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "We are Sandinistas, the heirs of General Sandino's\nwill.\n", "reason": "longer 57->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "To you, maybe. To us, he's more like a real father.\n", "reason": "longer 52->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Weird name.\n", "reason": "longer 12->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "We share the General's goal - to take back our\ncountry's freedom.\n", "reason": "longer 66->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "In his day, from America. In ours, from the despot\nSomoza.\n", "reason": "longer 59->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "\"Patria Libre o Morir\"... That is our slogan.\n", "reason": "longer 46->58"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "So you're fighting for a socialist revolution, too,\nthen?\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "No. It's not about ideology. We only want to live\nnormal lives.\n", "reason": "longer 64->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Where you never know if your neighbor is snitching\non you.\n", "reason": "longer 59->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Yeah. The Cuban Revolution started out like that,\ntoo...\n", "reason": "longer 57->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Augusto César Sandino... general and hero of\nNicaragua.\n", "reason": "longer 57->75"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The U.S. Marines intervened in the name of\nrestoring order.\n", "reason": "longer 60->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "And they certainly could not match the Marines'\nequipment.\n", "reason": "longer 59->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "How can people care so little about their own\ncountry?\n", "reason": "longer 55->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Sure. I know you do.\n", "reason": "longer 21->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Paz, you... I... Whatever you do, never stop loving\nyour country.\n", "reason": "longer 66->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "First Spain, then America. Over one hundred years\nof this...\n", "reason": "longer 61->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "I know.\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "an American mercenary named William Walker\nseized power in Nicaragua.\n", "reason": "longer 70->79"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "They snagged the rights so nobody else could\nbuild there...\n", "reason": "longer 60->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "at last driving them out. He was a true hero, and -\nto us Sandinistas - like a father.\n", "reason": "longer 87->134"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Cafetal Aroma Encantado... \"Enchanting Aroma,\"\nhuh?\n", "reason": "longer 52->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Sounds great. I wouldn't mind a cuppa joe after all\nthis is over. Oh, wait...\n", "reason": "longer 78->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "No, I... just remembered this guy I knew who wasn't\nbig on coffee. English.\n", "reason": "longer 76->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Ha! That's too bad for him - it is delicious.\n", "reason": "longer 46->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "El Cadalso... the Gallows. Charming.\n", "reason": "longer 37->41"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Oh...\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Los Cantos means \"Sword Peak.\"\n", "reason": "longer 31->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "What is it, Paz? You sound... upset.\n", "reason": "longer 37->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Yes, la Guardia. In name, a peacekeeping force.\n", "reason": "longer 48->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "\"Somoza may be a son of a bitch, but he's our son\nof a bitch.\"\n", "reason": "longer 63->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "and was assassinated by Somoza as he made his\nway home.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The river that flows between Nicaragua and Costa\nRica is el Río San Juan.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Of course. La Frente Sandinista de Liberación\nNacional...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "the Sandinista National Liberation Front is named\nin his honor.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I'll get him back. I promise.\n", "reason": "longer 30->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Seasoned, too - a lot of them probably saw action\nin Vietnam. They're a tough bunch.\n", "reason": "longer 85->107"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "How do you think? They're backed by the one and\nonly CIA.\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "And mi viejo... Without him, we...\n", "reason": "longer 35->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Yeah, I know.\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Can we, Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 15->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "But...\n", "reason": "longer 7->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Amanda!\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "What?\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "No, just afraid. Afraid of a communist Central\nAmerica.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "...Really?\n", "reason": "longer 11->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Si.\n", "reason": "longer 4->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Dammit, Kaz...\n", "reason": "longer 15->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "Yeah.\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "They loved him. And then...\n", "reason": "longer 28->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "He was assassinated - by Anastasio Somoza\nGarcia, commander of la Guardia.\n", "reason": "longer 75->99"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "You even transported pineapple grenades that\nway.\n", "reason": "longer 50->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "The name caught on among sympathizers in the\nregion and...\n", "reason": "longer 59->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_04.po", "msgid": "They call us watermelon sellers because the\nGeneral's name\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "If we had a comandante like him, the Sandinistas\nwould find the will to fight.\n", "reason": "longer 79->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Si. It means \"new man.\"\n", "reason": "longer 24->26"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "\"New man\"?\n", "reason": "longer 11->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Yeah, it seems that way. No human being could pull\noff those crazy maneuvers.\n", "reason": "longer 78->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "When we first saw it, one of my men said, \"Pilot\nmust be an hombre nuevo.\"\n", "reason": "longer 75->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Me, I do not like the name.\n", "reason": "longer 28->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Why?\n", "reason": "longer 5->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "What all of us who joined the Sandinistas strive to\nbecome. That's why!\n", "reason": "longer 72->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "It makes me furious to see the name given to such\na monster.\n", "reason": "longer 61->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Our name for the hummingbird. You saw how that\nchopper moved...\n", "reason": "longer 64->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "True. But better than hombre nuevo, don't you\nthink?\n", "reason": "longer 53->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "That's what took Chico...\n", "reason": "longer 26->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "There's plenty of guerrillas out there who'd rob\ntheir own people to feed their revolutions.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "They have no mercy. Once you've talked, they toss\nyou out like trash...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "They're well trained. They've got more than enough\nmen...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "...I...\n", "reason": "longer 8->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "...Snake...\n", "reason": "longer 12->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Listen to me. Don't ever let your men hear you talk\nlike that.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "When it feels like the fear and uncertainty could\ncrush you.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "You're the one your comrades look to for\nreassurance. That's what a leader is. Don't forget it.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "If you're looking for comfort, go find a church.\nThat's all I've got to say.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "You are right. I am sorry. I need to pull myself\ntogether.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "The land in our country belongs to us, and yet it\ndoesn't belong to us.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Along the coast, it is all banana groves. And in the\nmountains, it is coffee.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Almost all the bananas and coffee are sold as\nexports.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "The landlords keep the money for themselves,\nleaving precious little to the farmers.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Worse, the biggest landowners in the country are\nSomoza and his family.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I doubt even that, at least for bananas. The\nplantations are owned by American corporations.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "The bananas are processed in factories on the\nplantations and exported to America from private\nports...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "It's like having little American enclaves along the\ncoast of Nicaragua.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "But the farmers have no choice but to go work\nthere...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Es ridículo! The people have to take their land\nback.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Tell me... when exactly did you realize your dad\nwas working with the KGB?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "About six months ago. Up until then, we only had\nbeans to eat.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "And Snake...\n", "reason": "longer 13->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Since then I've had this fear of mosquitoes... When\nI hear them buzzing nearby, I get jumpy.\n", "reason": "longer 93->107"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Si. I thought it might help keep the mosquitoes\naway, just a little.\n", "reason": "longer 69->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Maybe it's all in my head. You're the same way,\nright?\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Me, too.\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I've gotta hand it to you. It takes guts to conquer\nyour fear like that\n", "reason": "longer 72->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Compared to him, I am no hero.\n", "reason": "longer 31->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "He was the last of the generation that knew\nGeneral Sandino...\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I can imagine.\n", "reason": "longer 15->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Thanks to him, la Frente held together even in the\nworst of times.\n", "reason": "longer 67->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "but once you talk to them you realize we've got\nplenty in common.\n", "reason": "longer 66->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "We may be enemies, but we're all still human\nbeings...\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "La CIA's soldiers, la Guardia... The same goes for\nthe people of America.\n", "reason": "longer 74->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "He did whatever the KGB said.\n", "reason": "longer 30->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "But I realize now... In the end all he did was help\npoison young people of America.\n", "reason": "longer 84->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I will never turn to drugs. Nor will I look to the KGB\nfor help.\n", "reason": "longer 65->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "So you're choosing a different path from your\nfather.\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Chico.\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Even today, my memory sometimes gets a little\nfuzzy.\n", "reason": "longer 53->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "The paths there are buried in vegetation.\n", "reason": "longer 42->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I know!\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Promise me this, though. When your fight is over,\nmake sure he gets a proper education.\n", "reason": "longer 88->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Give him a chance to be something other than a\nguerrilla.\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "OK. I promise.\n", "reason": "longer 15->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "UMAs. Yeah, I know.\n", "reason": "longer 20->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "He'll be fine. I know plenty of grown men who still\ngo crazy over UMAs.\n", "reason": "longer 72->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "You've taken such good care of me since you\nsaved me from el colibri.\n", "reason": "longer 70->78"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "but I'll be fine once I'm on my feet. Put me in a\ncombat unit - I'll pull my weight.\n", "reason": "longer 85->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I wouldn't expect any less from a Sandinista\ncomandante.\n", "reason": "longer 57->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "But seriously, it does not feel right for me to be\nsitting here while my compas are out risking their\nlives.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Yes, it is Heaven compared to living in the\nmountains.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Chico is a grown soldier now. I could not face him\notherwise.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Well said, Amanda. Those are the words of a true\ncomandante.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Stop... I was inspired by the greatest comandante I\nhave ever known, Boss.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "The path will gradually open up, and you'll come to\na fork in the road.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "so if you head down the middle you'll make for an\neasy target.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Well, it used to be a village - until they took control\nof it.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "It is a maze of paths, so watch out for soldiers on\npatrol.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Use the paths carefully and you should be able to\nstay out of view.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "One of the houses, most likely. You can peek\nthrough the doors.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Guards will still be on the move while you're looking\ninside. Make sure you don't get caught.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "That's your best chance.\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Just like Krasnogorje.\n", "reason": "longer 23->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Krasno-what?\n", "reason": "longer 13->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Even a freight train? Incredible!\n", "reason": "longer 34->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "and there are few places to hide. If you're going up\nthere,\n", "reason": "longer 60->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Good luck, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 18->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I can see several exits.\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "and naturally once they detonate the enemy will\nknow you're there.\n", "reason": "longer 67->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I wouldn't be surprised if he conducted a\ntop-secret nuclear test\n", "reason": "longer 66->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "You think? Then maybe Nahuelito really is a\ndinosaur.\n", "reason": "longer 54->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Wait a...\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "- it's already been confirmed as a real, living\ndinosaur.\n", "reason": "longer 58->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Africa...\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I wonder if I will...?\n", "reason": "longer 23->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "No!\n", "reason": "longer 4->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "With what? They'll find whatever he has on him.\n", "reason": "longer 48->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Ha ha ha. Just kidding. In Colombia, though, there's\na frog\n", "reason": "longer 60->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "He's not that big - less than two vara (5.5 ft)\n", "reason": "longer 48->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "...You really love UMAs, don't you, Chico?\n", "reason": "longer 43->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Did you see a quetzal, Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 30->42"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Yep.\n", "reason": "longer 5->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "A winged snake from Mayan and Aztec legend.\n", "reason": "longer 44->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "A winged snake...\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Weird, right? I bet it's a UMA.\n", "reason": "longer 32->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "and so they named it \"quetzal.\"\n", "reason": "longer 32->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Do not forget to check for signs of the enemy\nother than sight and sound.\n", "reason": "longer 74->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "An 80-foot-tall walking behemoth... The CIA's new\nweapon?\n", "reason": "longer 58->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Metal gear...\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "...What else could it be? If it is up there, I'll just\nhave to improvise.\n", "reason": "longer 74->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I'm only saying I heard stories from people who\nsaid they saw it.\n", "reason": "longer 66->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "But I know lots of places to find it in Nicaragua.\nYou wanna go have a look?\n", "reason": "longer 77->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "...Inside your head?\n", "reason": "longer 21->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Chico. I, uh... I met that talking cat.\n", "reason": "longer 40->58"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "In certain circles, yeah.\n", "reason": "longer 26->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I mean, it's got wings, and it's a reptile, so it\nprobably looks kind of like a snake, right?\n", "reason": "longer 94->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "and that they survived until the Mayan and Aztec\neras.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "A base disguised as a mine? We never made it\nthat far.\n", "reason": "longer 55->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Aliens?\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "the army actually announced they'd caught a flying,\ndisc-shaped object near Roswell, New Mexico.\n", "reason": "longer 97->101"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Maybe you don't know about it, but those army\nguys, they all know!\n", "reason": "longer 67->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Someday, I'm gonna be a hunter and catch some\nrare animals.\n", "reason": "longer 60->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Great, so I don't have to explain. I think she's a\nlong-lost dinosaur, don't you?\n", "reason": "longer 82->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "There weren't any mammals there, so no natural\npredators.\n", "reason": "longer 58->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Exactly! That's why there's been giant monster\nsightings in a bunch of other places\n", "reason": "longer 84->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "- like Nahuelito and Ogopogo.\n", "reason": "longer 30->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "...Yes, it is their drug refining plant. La CIA controls\nit now.\n", "reason": "longer 65->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Be sure to study their movements before you\nadvance.\n", "reason": "longer 53->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "What are you saying? I've been there before -\nwhen the KGB ran it - yes,\n", "reason": "longer 73->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I hope so.\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "He said it's where they transfer the cargo onto\ntrucks.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "I won't.\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Remember the locomotive? By the fork in the road\nbefore the village?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "An enemy tank! Is there somewhere you can hide,\nBoss?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "There are train cars, but they won't hold up\nagainst a gun like that.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Use them to look for an opportunity to hit its\ntreads or the fuel tank at the back, but...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "You can also stop it by taking out all the soldiers.\nYou can do it, Snake!\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Amanda, do I have to take the fork in the road\nback to the village?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "People say there is a shortcut. Go back to the\ncoffee factory entrance,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "They may have increased security in that area,\nthough.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Not surprising, after what happened with the tank.\nWhat do I do once I'm back at the village?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Destroy the barricade at the north side. From\nthere you can reconnect with the transport route.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "There's probably going to be a fight - one way or\nthe other.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "They might not see you if you stick to the\nnarrower pathways.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Don't let your guard down after taking out the\nbarricade, either.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Know the enemy's location before making any\nmoves.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_05.po", "msgid": "Enough, Boss. Time to stop talking and start using\nyour ears.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Sí.\n", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Must've been a heck of a battle. I wish I'd been\nthere.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "That's what makes you the boss, Boss! You don't\nneed any advice from me.\n", "reason": "longer 73->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Its name was Gear REX. They say nothing could kill\nit.\n", "reason": "longer 55->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "They say\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Sure... if it speaks human.\n", "reason": "longer 28->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Most cats' eyes do...\n", "reason": "longer 22->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "That's what makes you the Boss, Boss! Hey, say\nsomething in Trenya's language, will you?\n", "reason": "longer 89->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I know you must be excited, but we don't know\nwhat's out there.\n", "reason": "longer 64->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "No fair!\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Come on, Chico. This isn't as cut and dry as you\nthink.\n", "reason": "longer 56->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I'll take some photos if I get the chance. Sorry,\nkid, but that's life.\n", "reason": "longer 72->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Apparently there are other cats that talk besides\nTrenya on Isla del Monstruo.\n", "reason": "longer 79->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Yeah. Just when you think things can't get any\ncrazier...\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Also, the Felynes are nice to humans, so you be\nsure and be nice back.\n", "reason": "longer 71->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Not that way... they do look kinda like dinosaurs,\nthough. You don't think that's cool?\n", "reason": "longer 88->92"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "They say mammals multiplied and ate up their\neggs, but they can't all be gone.\n", "reason": "longer 79->101"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "I guess not... Yeah, you're right, dinosaurs've gotta\nbe big!\n", "reason": "longer 62->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Irazú has more than one crater, 'cause it's erupted\nso many times.\n", "reason": "longer 68->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Calderas, huh.\n", "reason": "longer 15->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "...Hey, I got an idea.\n", "reason": "longer 23->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "People all over the world tell stories about giant\nmonsters living in lakes.\n", "reason": "longer 77->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Nessie in Loch Ness, Nahuelito in Argentina,\nOgopogo in Canada...\n", "reason": "longer 66->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "They say that all these sightings prove dinosaurs\ndo still exist.\n", "reason": "longer 66->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Yeah, but... you know Mokèlé-mbèmbé? In the\nCongo River? He can walk on land.\n", "reason": "longer 82->105"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Like for instance you gotta watch out for poison\ndart frogs.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Take care of me?! I'm a warrior, like any other\nSandinista!\n", "reason": "longer 60->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Sorry. Guess I misspoke.\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Oh. Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 11->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Huh? No, not... really. Not really... I guess...\n", "reason": "longer 49->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Hey, Snake...\n", "reason": "longer 14->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Girls are funny, y'know?\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Wh-what's this about now?\n", "reason": "longer 26->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "No! It's not that! I just...\n", "reason": "longer 29->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "...Whenever I talk to Paz,\n", "reason": "longer 27->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "my heart starts pounding and everything I say\ncomes out wrong.\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Well, how do I talk to her?\n", "reason": "longer 28->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "...That is a tough one.\n", "reason": "longer 24->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Uh... Why don't you try... talking to her like you talk\nto everybody else?\n", "reason": "longer 75->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Our eyes meet, and my face starts burning for\nsome reason...\n", "reason": "longer 61->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "If only I hadn't run away...\n", "reason": "longer 29->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "She was carrying a gun - probably trained to use\nit, too.\n", "reason": "longer 58->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I know exactly how crushed he was. I feel it's my\nduty to further his AI research...\n", "reason": "longer 85->94"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "and try to guess their gender whether they're a\nwoman,\n", "reason": "longer 55->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "What if you hadn't used The Boss as the model for\nthe AI?\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Will?\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Let me explain, Snake. Peace Walker is a\nstand-alone weapon.\n", "reason": "longer 61->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "It can't do its job if it's not prepared to take sole\nresponsibility for the fate of the world.\n", "reason": "longer 96->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "...That's it?\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "If I'd promised not to tell anyone, Paz wouldn't\nhave gone and done what she did...\n", "reason": "longer 84->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Chico... when you saw Paz, she was trying to\nsabotage it, right?\n", "reason": "longer 65->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Huh? Well, yeah...\n", "reason": "longer 19->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I don't know...\n", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "If that were the case, she could have told me all\nthat from the beginning.\n", "reason": "longer 75->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I guess so...\n", "reason": "longer 14->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Chico...\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "If I'd talked to her... promised I wouldn't tell\nanybody...\n", "reason": "longer 60->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Yeah, but...\n", "reason": "longer 13->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Wait...the female brain?\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You were there with her...?\n", "reason": "longer 28->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "We connected because of our empathetic female\nbrains.\n", "reason": "longer 54->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Why would they...? Why did she have to...?\n", "reason": "longer 43->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I never knew...\n", "reason": "longer 16->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "The Boss' final act?\n", "reason": "longer 21->27"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "\"BS\" is short for Boss.\n", "reason": "longer 24->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "But if that were true, then couldn't you say that a\nmechanical \"body\"\n", "reason": "longer 70->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Yeah, thanks. Anyway...\n", "reason": "longer 24->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Crack?\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "The film offers amazing insights into AI - their\ngrowth, their utility, their faults - and their fear of\ndeath.\n", "reason": "longer 112->140"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You must have found it useful in your research,\nthen.\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Strangelove, when did you and The Boss first\nmeet?\n", "reason": "longer 51->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "It was also a chance to have them collect data on\nher.\n", "reason": "longer 55->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You intrigued me.\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Here?\n", "reason": "longer 6->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "The way you become intertwined, stimulate each\nother,\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Of course not. I deactivated it.\n", "reason": "longer 33->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Proof of her final act. Her true intentions. One way\nor another!\n", "reason": "longer 65->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "It can protect infantry, destroy the enemy, and, if\nordered...\n", "reason": "longer 63->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "So Huey was a nickname you gave him...\n", "reason": "longer 39->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Drone?\n", "reason": "longer 7->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Oh.. It's an American film directed by Douglas\nTrumbull,\n", "reason": "longer 57->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "He's a man!\n", "reason": "longer 12->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "Sorry to hear about your dad.\n", "reason": "longer 30->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "You sure?\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_06.po", "msgid": "What's with all this sighing? You're not your usual\nself.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Exactly. I heard a quetzal singing nearby.\n", "reason": "longer 43->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "It could be tricky if he's out on patrol, but if he's a\nstationary sentry...\n", "reason": "longer 77->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You don't think the quetzal's moved?\n", "reason": "longer 37->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Yes, I was. Not for pleasure, though - I am a\nresearcher, after all.\n", "reason": "longer 69->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Mmm. Even so, there sure are a lot of wild birds in\nCosta Rica.\n", "reason": "longer 64->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "How many can you name, Mr. Ornithologist?\n", "reason": "longer 42->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "But she took off the blindfold at bath time - so she\ncould wash my hair...\n", "reason": "longer 75->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Why'd you run away? Didn't she say you could go\nhome in a month?\n", "reason": "longer 65->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "If your escape attempt failed, you'd be in greater\ndanger than before.\n", "reason": "longer 71->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "on the distribution of Costa Rican bird species at a\nconference.\n", "reason": "longer 65->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I found an ID card and searched everywhere for\nmy equipment and my tape...\n", "reason": "longer 75->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "But a soldier saw me. It was a miracle I managed\nto get away.\n", "reason": "longer 62->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You don't?\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "....Not sure. I try not to dwell too much on the past,\nbut...\n", "reason": "longer 62->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Then don't. There's no point. I'm so glad to be out\nof there.\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "I never felt safe, you know?\n", "reason": "longer 29->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "They beat their wings far faster than any other\nbird.\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "The smallest ones over 70 times a second! Can\nyou imagine?\n", "reason": "longer 59->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "What for?\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "That's why Amanda and her unit called that\nchopper colibri.\n", "reason": "longer 60->78"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Never.\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "First, each young male picks an older male to\nteach him how to dance.\n", "reason": "longer 70->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "according to the mission's parameters?\n", "reason": "longer 39->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Especially not a machine.\n", "reason": "longer 26->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "The opposite direction... What does that mean?\n", "reason": "longer 47->66"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "But if your goal is to control society, it's the better\nmodel to use.\n", "reason": "longer 70->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Earlier, you called the Mammal Pod a butterfly. Not\na pupa or a cocoon, but an imago.\n", "reason": "longer 86->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Works in progress?\n", "reason": "longer 19->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "They weren't quite complete. They were pupae.\n", "reason": "longer 46->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Only when I added The Boss' data did the AI take\non its true form,\n", "reason": "longer 67->78"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Yeah...\n", "reason": "longer 8->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "...Right, Boss.\n", "reason": "longer 16->23"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "There were technical considerations, of course. To\nbegin with, the female brain\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "by which a computer makes decisions as an expert\nwould.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "is a system that decides which kinds of antibiotics\nto prescribe.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "You couldn't leave the world in the hands of\nsomething\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "Space is entirely too hazardous a place for human\nbeings.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "The real problem is, he doesn't have a whit of\nindependence in him.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "In Costa Rica, and even back at NASA he was\nalways following people around\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "there's a limit to the parts we can produce here at\nMother Base.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_07.po", "msgid": "For example, the more sensor memory boards you\nhave,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Tell him, Cécile.\n", "reason": "longer 19->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "If you say so...\n", "reason": "longer 17->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "The roar of the engine, the throaty steam whistle...\nMore animal than machine.\n", "reason": "longer 79->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "L-LESS civilized?!\n", "reason": "longer 19->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "I detest those beasts. The noise frightens off all\nthe birds.\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Cécile, wait! That... That came out wrong, I...\n", "reason": "longer 49->58"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "So tell me, where do macaws live in Costa Rica\ntoday?\n", "reason": "longer 54->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Oh c'mon now...\n", "reason": "longer 16->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Never heard the name \"Cosima\" before.\n", "reason": "longer 38->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "But Wagner's second wife was named Cosima\nFrancesca Gaetana Wagner.\n", "reason": "longer 68->90"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Huh.\n", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "You know, \"Kojima\" is a common last name in Japan.\n", "reason": "longer 51->55"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "I'm part Japanese and Cécile's middle name is so\nclose to \"Kojima.\"\n", "reason": "longer 69->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Oui oui! That's a beautiful name you have. Cécile\nCosima Caminades.\n", "reason": "longer 69->70"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Cécile Cosima Caminades... Cosima Caminades...\nHey, that’s close to...\n", "reason": "longer 74->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Yeah, that. What is that thing, anyway?\n", "reason": "longer 40->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Ha.\n", "reason": "longer 4->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Kaz?!\n", "reason": "longer 6->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "It is just like your beard, Snake!\n", "reason": "longer 35->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Macaws are a type of parrot... enormous, stately\nbirds.\n", "reason": "longer 56->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "You okay?\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Okay. So?!\n", "reason": "longer 11->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Umm, Kaz...?\n", "reason": "longer 13->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Yes. It is my favorite city.\n", "reason": "longer 29->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "You prefer war?\n", "reason": "longer 16->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Th-that is how you view France?!\n", "reason": "longer 33->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "To know everything about me without me\nsuspecting a thing.\n", "reason": "longer 59->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "I wonder.\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Descartes, Bataille, Sartre, Baudrillard...\n", "reason": "longer 44->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "...That's it.\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "...Nope.\n", "reason": "longer 9->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "The whole \"To arms, citizens. May an impure blood\nwater our furrows.\" thing, eh?\n", "reason": "longer 81->98"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Oh, and mille-feuilles, crêpes, blancmanges...\n", "reason": "longer 48->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Soufflés, croquembouches, canelés, floretins, kouign\namanns, Peach Melbas...\n", "reason": "longer 79->95"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Finished?\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "...And macarons! I love those the most.\n", "reason": "longer 40->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "and they contain meringue, so they melt right in\nyour mouth.\n", "reason": "longer 61->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Wow. I'd no idea macaroons were that popular in\nFrance, too.\n", "reason": "longer 61->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Well...\n", "reason": "longer 8->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Keep in mind \"macaron\" is almost identical to\n\"macaroni.\"\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Yeah?\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "They do, I swear!\n", "reason": "longer 18->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "but they migrate into the highland cloud forests\nduring breeding season.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "In the past, they were a common sight all across\nthe country,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "but lately the population has decreased\ndramatically.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Did you live in Paris your whole life before coming\nhere?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "So it can be a godsend for people from poor\ncountries.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Ah, La Marseillaise... Not everyone is a fan, of\ncourse.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "No, existentialism. Sometimes I wonder if my\nEnglish is not better than yours.\n", "reason": "longer 79->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Free? So he was one of those devil-may-care kind\nof guys, huh?\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "No, actually he meant that because we are free to\ncreate our own life,\n", "reason": "longer 71->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Tell me, Snake, do you ever put sweets in your\nrations?\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Doc, what are you...?\n", "reason": "longer 22->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Believe me, I know...\n", "reason": "longer 22->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "And now this... What peace was I trying to protect,\nanyway?\n", "reason": "longer 60->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Without a state - that is, without territory of their\nown\n", "reason": "longer 58->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "nicknamed \"Tsar Bomba.\"\n", "reason": "longer 24->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The explosion was seen as far off as Finland - 600\nmiles away\n", "reason": "longer 62->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "- and some people even reported windows\nshattering.\n", "reason": "longer 52->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...My research...\n", "reason": "longer 18->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "But the day may come when the proposition of\nnuclear terrorism\n", "reason": "longer 63->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Because it's a \"Walker.\"\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "To be honest, I was flattered.\n", "reason": "longer 31->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Flattered?\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "That's...\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "That's why I didn't want for these nukes to be\nanother sword of Damocles.\n", "reason": "longer 74->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Doc...\n", "reason": "longer 7->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "And Coldman... We have to stop him. Whatever it\ntakes.\n", "reason": "longer 55->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "I was 17 at the time. I'd skipped a few grades and\nwas a sophomore at MIT.\n", "reason": "longer 75->82"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Either that, or they were fanning that fear on\npurpose.\n", "reason": "longer 56->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "As a way to secure a bigger defense budget...?\nHeh, I can see that.\n", "reason": "longer 68->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Ouch.\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The S-mines, rockets, flamethrowers - they're all\nthe same, but\n", "reason": "longer 64->69"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "One of them is the Mammal Pod, which Dr.\nStrangelove developed.\n", "reason": "longer 64->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The parts of our brains that govern basic life and\nreflex developed ages ago,\n", "reason": "longer 78->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "We were reptiles?\n", "reason": "longer 18->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Dr. Strangelove came up with the name.\n", "reason": "longer 39->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The part of our brain that developed after we\nbecame mammals\n", "reason": "longer 61->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Such as?\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Until now.\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Shagohod?\n", "reason": "longer 10->12"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "A nuclear tank that launches IRBMs.\n", "reason": "longer 36->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "To create nukes for peace... Or so I thought,\nanyway.\n", "reason": "longer 54->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Why is Coldman gonna launch a nuke?\n", "reason": "longer 36->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Hello! Snake, mon chéri.\n", "reason": "longer 26->30"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Who?\n", "reason": "longer 5->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "What's he done now...\n", "reason": "longer 22->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Wine.\n", "reason": "longer 6->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Wine?\n", "reason": "longer 6->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "The stuff is a disaster.\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "They spent over two billion dollars - and that's in\n1940's money.\n", "reason": "longer 66->78"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "Doc?\n", "reason": "longer 5->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "...I can't walk.\n", "reason": "longer 17->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_08.po", "msgid": "That's right. Some of the finest minds of the 20th\ncentury,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The biggest nuclear warhead ever actually\ndetonated was the Soviet RDS-220,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "OK, but why does Peace Walker need to walk on\ntwo legs?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "As you know, the terrain in Central America is\nrugged and complex.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "And the only way to get across all that terrain, no\nmatter how rugged, is on legs.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "But wouldn't it be tough to cross a swamp even on\nlegs?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "The reason we picked Costa Rica as a proving\nground\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "This \"Peace Walker Project\" the CIA's talking about\n- you believed in it, huh?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Yeah. I believed... Actually, maybe I just wanted to\nbelieve.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Here's how Coldman explained it. Peace Walker's a\nweapon for peace,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "It'd be the anchor to bring stability to Central\nAmerica...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "He told me, \"The nuclear weapons system you've\nbuilt will never be used.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "And to achieve that, he needed my bipedal\nlocomotion technology...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "My colleagues in the scientific community have\nnever taken me seriously.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "They told me bipedal locomotion was a pipe dream,\nthat it'd never amount to anything.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "- without a warhead. I asked him the same thing at\nfirst.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Ah... So you're the \"American friend\" he was talking\nabout.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "He was so angry when he wrote that he smeared\nup the ink.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "And you know how shoddy the paper is over there\nto begin with.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Who but the Soviets would think of using a tank as\nthe first stage of a rocket?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I actually took a cue from the Shagohod when I\ndeveloped the Pupa.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "hover technology wasn't enough to handle all the\nterrain in Central America.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Did you in? ...So you were the one who took it\ndown!\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "We might not be here today if they'd begun\nmass-producing that thing.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Then again, they're hard at work now miniaturizing\nnuclear warheads.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Pretty soon they won't even need an accelerated\nlauncher like the Shagohod.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "So that was vapor.\n", "reason": "longer 19->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Nice.\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Nah, I'll stick with cigars.\n", "reason": "longer 29->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Did I ever tell you about the time we first met up\nin Costa Rica?\n", "reason": "longer 66->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "No.\n", "reason": "longer 4->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "You should ask her about \"2001,\" too. Then you'll\nunderstand just how amazing she is.\n", "reason": "longer 86->87"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "A what?\n", "reason": "longer 8->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Not at mine.\n", "reason": "longer 13->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "And you think that's why you can't walk?\n", "reason": "longer 41->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "whether it affects genes.\n", "reason": "longer 26->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Really... them too, huh...\n", "reason": "longer 27->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Only thing is, the upper radiators typically aren't\nexposed.\n", "reason": "longer 61->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "You could move under its body to access the\nlower ones,\n", "reason": "longer 56->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I adapted the technology for use as a surface\nweapon.\n", "reason": "longer 54->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Huh? No, I'm serious...\n", "reason": "longer 24->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "It's true. NORAD tracks his...\n", "reason": "longer 31->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "OK, OK, I get it.\n", "reason": "longer 18->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...He's real, I tell ya.\n", "reason": "longer 25->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Ugh...\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Location-wise, the mammal brain is on the outside\nof the reptile brain.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I think it's very telling that Dr. Strangelove named\nher pod \"Mammal.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "It's almost like she wants it to be more than just\nan advanced AI\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "- what she really wants is for it to have a mind of\nits own.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Snake, how much do you know about the U.S.\nhomeland air defense network?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I don't know much about what goes on up in the\nsky.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "What I do know is that NORAD tracks Santa Claus\non its radar.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Ha! Nice one. I didn't know you were a comedian,\ntoo!\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Listen to me! Every December, they set up a\nhotline and...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "keeping tabs on Santa Claus is a very important\njob for NORAD.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "But they also have another mission - the one they\nwere created for.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...You mean Peace Walker's fake data\ntransmissions?\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "NORAD's early warning system is composed of DSP\nsatellite-mounted infrared sensors,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "and an array of surveillance radar stations across\nNorth America.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The same conclusion, again and again... Where is\nthe flaw?\n", "reason": "longer 59->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I shoot him.\n", "reason": "longer 13->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...I shoot him.\n", "reason": "longer 16->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "To spare him the grief. One must die, and one\nmust live.\n", "reason": "longer 57->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...Next question.\n", "reason": "longer 18->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I jump down.\n", "reason": "longer 13->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...Next.\n", "reason": "longer 9->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Launched... the nuke? Me?\n", "reason": "longer 26->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Nuclear weapons... make my blood run cold. They\nblot out the future. How... could I...?\n", "reason": "longer 88->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Karma... Is... is it my karma?\n", "reason": "longer 31->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The karma my mistake has brought upon us... My...\nMy...\n", "reason": "longer 56->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Snake!\n", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "N-no...\n", "reason": "longer 8->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "You did!\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I mean...\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "So I...\n", "reason": "longer 8->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "So you read the letter. After I specifically told you\nnot to!\n", "reason": "longer 62->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...What do you expect people to do when you tell\nthem not to read something...?\n", "reason": "longer 80->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "I thought I knew you, Snake! I thought I could trust\nyou!!\n", "reason": "longer 59->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...Look, I'm sorry. But I just don't get what you see\nin her.\n", "reason": "longer 62->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Huh?! N-no, I... No way, I could never...\n", "reason": "longer 42->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Yeah. A spacecraft pilot AI called HAL. It plays a\nmajor role in the story.\n", "reason": "longer 76->88"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...I fight him.\n", "reason": "longer 16->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I... must fight him.\n", "reason": "longer 21->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Kill me... Kill me now...\n", "reason": "longer 26->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Life's end... Isn't it beautiful...?\n", "reason": "longer 37->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...Always in the same place, her reasoning goes\nhaywire.\n", "reason": "longer 57->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I told the man that with no more money from the\nKGB,\n", "reason": "longer 53->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...I chase it away.\n", "reason": "longer 20->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Go home!\n", "reason": "longer 9->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...Kill me... Kill me now...\n", "reason": "longer 29->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Why not kill the snake? Your mission is to get rid\nof it.\n", "reason": "longer 58->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "What are you loyal to? Country? Ideology?\nFeelings?\n", "reason": "longer 52->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I... I...\n", "reason": "longer 10->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Intruder!\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "August 24.\n", "reason": "longer 11->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Tselinoyarsk, USSR.\n", "reason": "longer 20->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Mission?\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "quoting Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 15->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "it wasn't even half a vara (16 in). Rather\nanti-climactic.\n", "reason": "longer 59->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Hey! As long as I'm here at Mother Base, why not\nassign me to the R&D team?\n", "reason": "longer 76->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "So this Dr. Strangelove was at NASA?\n", "reason": "longer 37->47"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Not exactly \"together.\" We coordinated on a few\nthings,\n", "reason": "longer 56->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "We had it worked out so that Dr. Strangelove\nhandled the Mammal Pod,\n", "reason": "longer 69->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Huh? Er, no, it's, uh...\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Research findings? Anything in there we could use\nagainst Peace Walker?\n", "reason": "longer 72->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "N-nothing! Nothing at all!\n", "reason": "longer 27->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...Uh, no.\n", "reason": "longer 11->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Why not? I gave it to you for a reason. It's highly\nimportant information.\n", "reason": "longer 75->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Yeah. Well, actually, Strangelove left for DARPA not\nlong after I joined.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Both the missiles and hedgehogs take time to load,\nthough.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Fifty-seven.\n", "reason": "longer 13->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Two-oh-four-eight Zulu.\n", "reason": "longer 24->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "Unknown.\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "With both sides destroyed, global anarchy would\nensue.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_09.po", "msgid": "...Tell me, how do you define enemy?\n", "reason": "longer 37->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "and then launch the nuke at the weapons design\nbureau.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I was disloyal... Betrayed my country... I deserve to\ndie...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "When he got a better offer from Moscow, he took\nit.\n", "reason": "longer 52->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The mystery device attached to Sputnik 5 was for\nthat purpose.\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Crazy, I know.\n", "reason": "longer 15->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "So much so that they gave Yuri Gagarin, the first\nman in space,\n", "reason": "longer 64->73"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Yes... Of course.\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Speaking of which, any news on the \"sons\"...?\n", "reason": "longer 46->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Two already... Really...\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Yes, I'll be in touch...\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "my dear Zero (CIPHER).\n", "reason": "longer 23->29"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "How's that map, Snake? Think you can\nuse it?\n", "reason": "longer 45->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Costa Rica's party to the Tlatelolco\nTreaty,\n", "reason": "longer 45->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "It was a world without borders. A perfect jewel.\n", "reason": "longer 49->58"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "All nations, all ideologies - they seemed so far away.\n", "reason": "longer 55->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "It almost made her laugh, knowing that they'd\nrisked so much\n", "reason": "longer 61->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...It's me.\n", "reason": "longer 12->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Yes, other eyes continue to watch, but no sign of\ncontact so far.\n", "reason": "longer 66->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "...Exactly. It's a non-state army to use however\nthey want.\n", "reason": "longer 60->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Agreed. In the end, a machine is just that: a\nmachine.\n", "reason": "longer 55->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "They welcomed us warmly.\n", "reason": "longer 25->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "With so few women aboard Mother Base, I'm\ntreated like a princess.\n", "reason": "longer 67->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "As always,\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "As I sat there feeding them lies, the fish began to\nbite,\n", "reason": "longer 58->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "If word of this gets out, OPANAL will be\nforced to act.\n", "reason": "longer 56->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The Treaty was signed to prevent\nanother Cuban Missile Crisis.\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Well... If they did bring nukes, we can't let\nthem get away with it.\n", "reason": "longer 69->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Good question. Why bring them here? I\ncan't figure it out.\n", "reason": "longer 59->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Whatever the CIA's up to in Costa Rica,\nthe \"professor\" wants it stopped.\n", "reason": "longer 74->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Working as fast as we can, Boss. This\nplace is pretty beat... It looks like hell.\n", "reason": "longer 82->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "But as long as you're with us, we'll make\nit heaven.\n", "reason": "longer 53->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "No one can bother us here. No state\ntelling us what to do.\n", "reason": "longer 59->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "This is the MSF's haven, our Mother Base.\n", "reason": "longer 42->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Snake, I rigged that radio so you can\ncontact our young lady friend Paz.\n", "reason": "longer 73->94"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Is she OK?\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake...?\n", "reason": "longer 10->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Ah, sorry.\n", "reason": "longer 11->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yeah, me too.\n", "reason": "longer 14->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "But stay alert.\n", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Whatever it was, it looked unmanned.\n", "reason": "longer 37->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Unmanned? I'd heard rumors, but an\noperational unit...?\n", "reason": "longer 56->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "How? Our source is dead.\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Roger.\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "The direction Amanda's Sandinistas were\ngoing\n", "reason": "longer 46->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Amanda, how do you feel?\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "I named it Nuke.\n", "reason": "longer 17->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "and thought back to the deep-sea dives I had to\ndo as part of training.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "but I remember finding the multi-colored fish\ngliding through the water incredibly soothing.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Nuke was hovering nearby with an expectant look\non his face, so I gave the fish to him.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "but it has legions of rabid fans all across Latin\nAmerica.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "that it is commonly believed El Salvador and\nHonduras went to war in 1969 over scuffles in a\nsoccer match.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "In reality, tensions between the two countries were\nalready high.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The match was merely one of the sparks that set\nthem off.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "But these people are so passionate about the\nsport\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "into Costa Rican and Nicaraguan teams and\nstarted playing each other.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The R&D team built and set up simple goals on the\ndeck.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "but the players and spectators alike got pretty\nexcited.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Huey, the referee, blew a whistle to start the\nmatch.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The soldiers' training has left them in excellent\nphysical shape.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Midway through, one of the men collided with\nanother.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "They started shouting at one another, but Huey\nstepped in.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "And we are not fighting for the good of any one\ncountry.\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "\"This is not a war. Soccer's a peaceful sport, am I\nright?\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Their ineptitude had caused the fiasco in the first\nplace.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The Soviets' deception was brilliant. They'd woven\na masterful tapestry of truth and fiction\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "to convince the Americans their intelligence\noperations were proceeding as planned.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "It was obvious the Soviets had some gifted minds\nworking on their side.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "But that certainly didn't excuse the CIA's massive\nfailure.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "and devised an ingenious plan to avoid taking\nresponsibility.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "Luckily for them, a new President had been elected\nthe previous November - John F. Kennedy.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "As he didn't know the case history when taking\noffice,\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "the CIA was able to feed lies to his new\nadministration.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "They masked their own failures, placing the blame\nsquarely on The Boss's shoulders.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "They claimed she'd failed to make use of one of\nthe most effective means\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The Boss was well aware that would have worked -\nshe told me so later.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "It seems clear it had to do with having her own\nchild taken.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "She could never inflict the same pain on anyone\nelse.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "In his election campaign, Kennedy had vowed to\nclose the missile gap with Moscow.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "If America lost the space race, that promise would\nbe worthless.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "The fact that the President had no links to the\nPhilosophers only made things worse.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "He was completely unaware of the secret networks\nshe'd used to complete her mission.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Unless we catch those spears before\nreaching it, they'll be in enemy hands.\n", "reason": "longer 76->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "If we can't cut 'em off at that terminal,\nwe'll be in a world of hurt.\n", "reason": "longer 71->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Hurry, Snake!\n", "reason": "longer 14->15"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Either neutralize the soldiers or destroy\nthe tank. Get 'em!\n", "reason": "longer 61->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake, the truck is headed up the\nmountain road past the tunnel.\n", "reason": "longer 65->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Any other routes?\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yeah. Got one?\n", "reason": "longer 15->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Let's see... You remember that prison I\nwas in?\n", "reason": "longer 48->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "I ...You're right.\n", "reason": "longer 19->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "...Welcome to hell.\n", "reason": "longer 20->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Shoot.\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Not just that. Because they're compas...\n", "reason": "longer 41->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "And what?\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "I'm talking about UMAs.\n", "reason": "longer 24->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "U... M... As?\n", "reason": "longer 14->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Is that right. OK, sure.\n", "reason": "longer 25->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Careful, Snake!!\n", "reason": "longer 17->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Sounds good to me, Doc. I'll do that.\n", "reason": "longer 38->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "It crosses over a gorge. That's probably\nthe best way...\n", "reason": "longer 57->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "No, I mean... We'll have to see.\n", "reason": "longer 33->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Which means they've probably built a\nbase inside the mountain...\n", "reason": "longer 65->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "What do they hope to accomplish by\nbringing the nukes there?\n", "reason": "longer 61->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "That's its final destination. We've got no\nintel on what lies beyond, so stay sharp.\n", "reason": "longer 85->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Wonderful. For a moment, I felt what it\nmust be like to be a bird.\n", "reason": "longer 67->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yes. But it was confiscated when the\nguards caught me.\n", "reason": "longer 55->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yeah, they all look pretty much the same.\nWhere did it happen?\n", "reason": "longer 63->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Let me think...\n", "reason": "longer 16->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Ah, yes! I do remember hearing the song\nof a nearby quetzal.\n", "reason": "longer 61->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "It's my quetzal. I took it with me when I\nwas rescued.\n", "reason": "longer 55->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "If you want to hear the quetzal's song\nagain, just let me know.\n", "reason": "longer 64->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "I can tell you all about the birds of Costa\nRica, too.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yeah... will do. Thanks, Cecile.\n", "reason": "longer 33->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "No, no, thank you, Snake. Talk to you\nsoon.\n", "reason": "longer 44->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Kaz, did you play that tape for Cecile?\n", "reason": "longer 40->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake, I'm worried.\n", "reason": "longer 20->24"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Worried?\n", "reason": "longer 9->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "What are you saying, Kaz?\n", "reason": "longer 26->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "\"Someone has to be first,\" she said. \"If fate has\nchosen me, then I accept.\n", "reason": "longer 76->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_10.po", "msgid": "If anyone can get through this, I can.\"\n", "reason": "longer 40->46"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Still just a kid.\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "...I guess.\n", "reason": "longer 12->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Paz. Where are you?\n", "reason": "longer 20->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Teacher? Oh, him. He's... Yeah, that's\nprobably good advice.\n", "reason": "longer 61->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Si. He has a radio in his room, so we can\ntalk anytime.\n", "reason": "longer 56->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Thank you. Snake, if you need to know\nabout Costa Rica\n", "reason": "longer 55->73"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "- the geography, the climate, the wildlife,\nanything - just ask me.\n", "reason": "longer 68->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "...I, uh...\n", "reason": "longer 12->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "In school I also learned that peace is an\nunnatural state for human society.\n", "reason": "longer 77->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "So, to achieve peace, we have to create\nit ourselves.\n", "reason": "longer 54->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Crying about it won't bring it about, or\nmake it last.\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "No offense, but I don't know what peace\nis.\n", "reason": "longer 44->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Never felt what it's like. Never even been\ninterested in it.\n", "reason": "longer 61->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "She's not. Cecile says she's never even\nmet Paz.\n", "reason": "longer 49->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "You know what to do!\n", "reason": "longer 21->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "She played me like a piano...\n", "reason": "longer 30->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Let's hope so. See what you can get out\nof the KGB, Kaz.\n", "reason": "longer 57->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake, we haven't detected any signs\nthat Peace Walker's been activated,\n", "reason": "longer 73->76"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "This time, it's really our last chance.\nDestroy that AI!\n", "reason": "longer 57->64"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Kaz, Peace Walker's gone... They've got\nPaz, too.\n", "reason": "longer 50->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Why, Kaz? What would Coldman want with\nPaz?\n", "reason": "longer 44->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Paz was with the \"professor\", i.e., the\nKGB.\n", "reason": "longer 45->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "and he thinks he can get the info from\nPaz.\n", "reason": "longer 44->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Dammit! I can't believe we didn't realize\nwhat was going on before we lost\ncontact with Paz.\n", "reason": "longer 93->99"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Right. This isn't about money anymore.\nYou better move. We know where they're\nheaded.\n", "reason": "longer 86->96"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Chico, you made it.\n", "reason": "longer 20->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Amanda, a word of advice.\n", "reason": "longer 26->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Yes... yes, I know. You're right. I shouldn't.\n", "reason": "longer 47->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a\ngun, and sooner or later you're going to\nhell.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "That's where the enemy's base has got\nto be, Snake. And maybe...\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake, she died a decade ago.\n", "reason": "longer 30->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Sorry! Hey, you OK?\n", "reason": "longer 20->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Nice work.\n", "reason": "longer 11->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "So did I. Here's the deal.\n", "reason": "longer 27->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "nor Paz had been seen there in quite\nsome time.\n", "reason": "longer 48->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "...Coldman knew about us. We've been\nmarked by the CIA.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "The KGB and Paz brought us into all this.\nColdman must know about them, too.\n", "reason": "longer 77->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "You think... Coldman's got them...?\n", "reason": "longer 36->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "No. Remember, Gálvez isn't some\npencil-pusher.\n", "reason": "longer 48->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake! That's a Hind! You've got to take\nit out somehow!\n", "reason": "longer 57->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Either neutralize the soldiers or bring\ndown the chopper! Good luck!\n", "reason": "longer 69->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake,\n", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "The lab's built into some ancient ruins, so\nfind those first!\n", "reason": "longer 62->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "...Say, if she decides she doesn't like that\ncard's carrier.\n", "reason": "longer 61->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Great...\n", "reason": "longer 9->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 7->9"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Kaz, where's Cecile?\n", "reason": "longer 21->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Slip in and terminate that AI before they\nship it out.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Kaz, I thought I knew everything about\nher.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "When she didn't believe me, I realized\nsomething.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Hm. Fine, then. There's no point in\narguing. Peace Walker is on the verge of\ncompletion.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Snake, the Peace Walker platform and AI\nhave been shipped to the final testing\nbase.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Dammit, you've been spotted by the\nguards! Take them out before they take\nyou out!\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "Infiltrate the base and put a stop to the\nproject by destroying Peace Walker's AI\npod.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_11.po", "msgid": "The person at the school said neither the\n\"professor\"\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Find Zadornov, Snake!\n", "reason": "longer 22->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Snake, Zadornov's escaped. You have to\nfind him!\n", "reason": "longer 49->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Yeah. What's up?\n", "reason": "longer 17->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "What happened?\n", "reason": "longer 15->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "No, she's in sickbay.\n", "reason": "longer 22->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Let her go.\n", "reason": "longer 12->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Kaz, I caught Zadornov.\n", "reason": "longer 24->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I-impossible! I thought I'd made it...\n", "reason": "longer 39->43"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I got him, Kaz.\n", "reason": "longer 16->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "...Slipped up again...\n", "reason": "longer 23->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Umm... Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 14->18"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Don't tell me... Zadornov?\n", "reason": "longer 27->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Okay, okay...\n", "reason": "longer 14->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Snake! Zadornov's done it again!\n", "reason": "longer 33->36"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "great...\n", "reason": "longer 9->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Gimme a break...\n", "reason": "longer 17->19"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "C'mon!\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "The problem is when a nation comes to\nrely on it.\n", "reason": "longer 50->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "That's why I, one without a nation, see\npotential in MSF.\n", "reason": "longer 58->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Got it. Thanks, Huey.\n", "reason": "longer 22->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "But hey,\n", "reason": "longer 9->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "In any case, I need to go talk to Dr.\nStrangelove.\n", "reason": "longer 51->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Huey!\n", "reason": "longer 6->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Listen, Boss,\n", "reason": "longer 14->20"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Now what?\n", "reason": "longer 10->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Why? So she can come back in a body\nbag?\n", "reason": "longer 41->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Amanda isn't the type to just sit around\nin sickbay.\n", "reason": "longer 53->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "She'll be a huge morale boost - that can\nonly benefit MSF.\n", "reason": "longer 59->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "You're good at fighting, Kaz - one of the\nbest...\n", "reason": "longer 50->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "but you've got a lot to learn when it\ncomes to people.\n", "reason": "longer 55->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Don't worry, she won't let us down.\n", "reason": "longer 36->40"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "They've finished plans for a new hex-type\nplant.\n", "reason": "longer 49->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Only thing is, we don't have nearly\nenough GMP.\n", "reason": "longer 48->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We'll need to recruit more soldiers to get\nmore GMP. You know what to do, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 81->89"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Got a sec, Snake?\n", "reason": "longer 18->21"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "It's about Paz. You know, she doesn't\nhave any family.\n", "reason": "longer 55->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "She got a scholarship thanks to\nZadornov, and was living at the dorms...\n", "reason": "longer 73->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "But he was KGB.\n", "reason": "longer 16->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "So I figure we'll need a Medical Team for\nthat.\n", "reason": "longer 48->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Boss! I had an idea. Listen to this.\n", "reason": "longer 37->38"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Lemme guess.\n", "reason": "longer 13->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "That way we're better prepared - no\nmatter where we end up.\n", "reason": "longer 60->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Hey, Boss, you mind if we powwow for a\nsec?\n", "reason": "longer 44->50"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I know... You're right.\n", "reason": "longer 24->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Snake, Peace Walker has crossed the\nborder\n", "reason": "longer 43->44"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Coldman's targeting the MSF plant -\nthat's us.\n", "reason": "longer 47->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I'm adding a new mission. Find the KGB\nagent Zadornov!\n", "reason": "longer 55->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Find him!\n", "reason": "longer 10->13"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Heh heh... So you found me.\n", "reason": "longer 28->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Kaz, I've got Zadornov. Returning home.\n", "reason": "longer 40->52"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Bad news, Snake. Zadornov's on the loose.\n", "reason": "longer 42->45"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "What, again?!\n", "reason": "longer 14->25"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Impossible. Anyway, I'm adding a new\nmission. Locate and recover Zadornov!\n", "reason": "longer 75->77"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "But first, see what we've got going on at\nMother Base, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 62->70"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We've finished developing C4 charges.\nTake some with you.\n", "reason": "longer 58->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Snake... If we don't step up weapons and\nitems development here,\n", "reason": "longer 65->70"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Snake, we need more guys for weapons\nand items development.\n", "reason": "longer 60->67"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "If you succeed, our efforts in this area\nwill be made that much easier.\n", "reason": "longer 72->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I know you can do it. Get out there and\nkick some ass!\n", "reason": "longer 55->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We've got a... uh, special request for you\ntoday.\n", "reason": "longer 50->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We need you to hunt it down and save\nour Outer Heaven!\n", "reason": "longer 55->62"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "dummy\n", "reason": "longer 6->7"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Okay. To deploy troops, select \"Outer\nOps\" from the Mother Base Menu.\n", "reason": "longer 70->80"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Yeah. We could lose men.\n", "reason": "longer 25->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Package for you, Boss.\n", "reason": "longer 23->26"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Don't worry, it's clean. No trace of\nexplosives or anything.\n", "reason": "longer 61->74"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "EVA...\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Ho ho hooo, the plot thickens. Tidings\nfrom an old flame?\n", "reason": "longer 58->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Don't start, Kaz. Anyway, I'll check it out\nlater.\n", "reason": "longer 51->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "OK, just don't go running off after this\nchick.\n", "reason": "longer 48->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Got anything you can use to blow up that\nbarricade?\n", "reason": "longer 52->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "It depends on what kind of barricade it is,\nbut...\n", "reason": "longer 51->53"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "OK. But Kaz,\n", "reason": "longer 13->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I know, Snake. I'm not trying to turn her\ninto one of us.\n", "reason": "longer 58->61"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "And, ah,\n", "reason": "longer 9->16"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Dr. Strangelove wants to come, too.\n", "reason": "longer 36->37"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Strangelove?\n", "reason": "longer 13->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Well... We're an army without borders.\n", "reason": "longer 39->49"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "No clue. Can't imagine he's just out to\nannoy us, though.\n", "reason": "longer 58->71"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "You know, it might not be worth keeping\nhim here. If he's not going to join us...\n", "reason": "longer 82->86"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "You may be right.\n", "reason": "longer 18->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I thought it might boost our Russian\ncompatriots' morale, but...\n", "reason": "longer 65->68"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I've added a new mission. Go get\nZadornov!\n", "reason": "longer 43->56"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Found our friend, Kaz.\n", "reason": "longer 23->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Great. Good work, Snake.\n", "reason": "longer 25->33"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I found him, Kaz.\n", "reason": "longer 18->28"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Close... but no cigar.\n", "reason": "longer 23->34"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Not for you, anyway. Snake, We're coming\nto pick him up.\n", "reason": "longer 57->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Zadornov's missing again.\n", "reason": "longer 26->31"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "You think I have time to assemble a mole\nhunt?\n", "reason": "longer 47->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Man, this guy isn't just good, he's so good\nit's scary.\n", "reason": "longer 56->59"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Anyway, he left a trail, so we've got a\ngood idea of where he's probably hiding.\n", "reason": "longer 81->83"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "I won't try and force you. You're the one\ncalling the shots here, Boss.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We can't afford for you to be \"distracted\"\nright now.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 2->1"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "OK so far. Still shocked about being lied\nto by Zadornov...\n", "reason": "longer 60->65"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Really.\n", "reason": "longer 8->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "Still,\n", "reason": "longer 7->10"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "it's got to be depressing for a girl her\nage to be cooped up on an offshore plant\nall day,\n", "reason": "longer 91->96"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "...Yyyyeah.\n", "reason": "longer 12->22"}
{"file": "D:\\PWSF\\src\\codec\\codec_12.po", "msgid": "We're getting dozens of reports of\ndamage to nearby houses and other\nbuildings.\n", "reason": "repair-failed newline 3->2"}
